{"id":6,"jsonrpc":"2.0","result":{"content":[{"text":"{\"designSystems\":[{\"name\":\"assets/9e94db217f4d4a22bd4ec005375dd8ad\",\"designSystem\":{\"displayName\":\"Obsidian Cyber-Shield\",\"styleGuidelines\":\"## Brand & Style\\nThis design system adapts Material Design 3 Expressive for high-security consumer networking and privacy software. It blends deep obsidian surfaces with electric cybernetic illumination, projecting impregnable operational defense, near-zero latency, and military-grade telemetry. \\n\\nThe aesthetic synthesizes:\\n- **Glassmorphic Obsidian**: Multi-tiered semi-translucent dark surfaces featuring back-layer diffusion, fine boundary highlights, and disciplined contrast.\\n- **Bioluminescent Accents**: Electric emerald and neon mint glows that function as authoritative indicators of cryptographic connection states.\\n- **Cyber-Precision Telemetry**: Monospace tabular metrics paired with soft, rounded typography to balance technical credibility with consumer approachability.\\n\\nThe emotional signature is calming invulnerability: users transition from raw, exposed network environments into an encrypted, monitored enclosure.\\n\\n## Layout & Spacing\\nThe layout system uses an 8dp baseline grid (with 4dp sub-increments for dense data points), structured around full-width responsive containment zones.\\n\\n- **Grid Architecture**:\\n  - **Mobile (\\u003c600dp)**: 4 fluid columns, 16dp margins, 16dp gutters. Single-column stacked cards.\\n  - **Tablet (600–1024dp)**: 8 fluid columns, 32dp margins, 24dp gutters. Two-column layout split between earth wireframe telemetry and server configuration.\\n  - **Desktop (\\u003e1024dp)**: 12 fluid columns, 48dp margins, 32dp gutters with a max canvas width of 1440dp.\\n- **Rhythm & Safe Areas**:\\n  - Top canvas maintains 16dp spacing below system status bars.\\n  - Bottom edge incorporates an 88dp clearance offset to float the bottom navigation dock without obscuring interactive controls.\\n- **Density**: Cards use 16dp to 24dp internal padding (`space-md` to `space-lg`), keeping compact layouts readable.\\n\\n## Elevation & Depth\\nDepth is built with tinted ambient glows and translucent glass layering rather than traditional drop shadows.\\n\\n- **Base Canvas**: Pure `#0B0F17`, no elevation.\\n- **Surface Elevation 1 (Cards)**:\\n  - Fill: `#141B26` at 85% opacity with `backdrop-filter: blur(20px)`.\\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`.\\n  - Ambient Glow: Soft bottom glow (`0px 12px 32px -8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)`).\\n- **Surface Elevation 2 (Active/Connected Cards)**:\\n  - Fill: `#1E2638` at 90% opacity with `backdrop-filter: blur(24px)`.\\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.3)`.\\n  - Ambient Glow: `0px 8px 30px rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.12)`, producing an emerald aura around the active server.\\n- **Surface Elevation 3 (Floating Nav Dock & Modals)**:\\n  - Fill: `#101722` at 80% opacity with `backdrop-filter: blur(28px)`.\\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12)`.\\n  - Ambient Shadow: `0px 20px 40px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8)`.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Hero Connection Controller\\n- The primary connection module features an interactive multi-ring component enclosing a holographic 3D wireframe Earth.\\n- **Disconnected State**: Rings render in `#1E2638` with static 1px borders; central power glyph tinted `#737C8C`.\\n- **Connected State**: Rings render in `#00E58F` with an outer pulsing halo (`0 0 40px rgba(0, 255, 133, 0.35)`). A subtle rotational radar sweep runs at 0.5Hz.\\n- Touch target: minimum 120dp circular area with 48dp minimum internal strike-zone.\\n\\n### Buttons & Interactive CTAs\\n- **Primary Glowing CTA**: \\n  - Height: 56dp (touch safe).\\n  - Background: Gradient from `#00E58F` to `#00FF85`.\\n  - Text: `#0B0F17` in `label-lg` ExtraBold.\\n  - Box Shadow: `0 4px 20px rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.4)`.\\n  - Hover/Active: Translates to a scale of 0.98; brightness increases by 10%.\\n- **Secondary Ghost Button**:\\n  - Height: 48dp.\\n  - Background: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04)`.\\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12)`.\\n  - Text: `#FFFFFF` in `label-lg` SemiBold.\\n\\n### Floating Bottom Navigation Dock\\n- Height: 64dp, margin: 16dp horizontal, floating 24dp above device edge.\\n- Radius: 28dp, fill: `#101722` at 85% opacity with 24px blur.\\n- Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`.\\n- Active Icon: Highlighted with an emerald indicator pill (`rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.15)`) with an icon color of `#00E58F`.\\n- Minimum tap target for each tab: 48dp × 48dp.\\n\\n### Cards & Telemetry Containers\\n- **Server Selection Tile**: \\n  - Height: 72dp.\\n  - Background: `#141B26` with 24dp radius and 1px `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)` border.\\n  - Country flag indicator, server location in `title-sm`, ping latency badge in `#38BDF8`.\\n  - Active state triggers a 1px border of `#00E58F` with 8% emerald fill tint.\\n- **Live Metrics Card**:\\n  - Two-column card showing upstream and downstream speeds.\\n  - Download: Cyan (`#38BDF8`) glyph with `metric-md` numeric counter.\\n  - Upload: Neon Mint (`#00FF85`) glyph with `metric-md` numeric counter.\\n\\n### Switches, Toggles & Checkboxes\\n- **MD3 Expressive Switch**:\\n  - Track: 52dp width × 32dp height, fully rounded pill. Unchecked track `#1E2638`; checked track `#00E58F`.\\n  - Thumb: 24dp circle. Unchecked `#737C8C`; checked `#0B0F17`.\\n  - Integrated with haptic feedback tick upon state change.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- Height: 56dp.\\n- Fill: `#141B26`, border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)`. Radius: 16dp.\\n- Focused State: Border changes to 1.5px solid `#00E58F` with `box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.2)`.\",\"theme\":{\"colorMode\":\"DARK\",\"font\":\"PLUS_JAKARTA_SANS\",\"roundness\":\"ROUND_EIGHT\",\"customColor\":\"#00e58f\",\"headlineFont\":\"PLUS_JAKARTA_SANS\",\"bodyFont\":\"PLUS_JAKARTA_SANS\",\"labelFont\":\"PLUS_JAKARTA_SANS\",\"namedColors\":{\"inverse_on_surface\":\"#2c3039\",\"on_secondary_fixed\":\"#00210c\",\"surface_container_high\":\"#262a33\",\"inverse_surface\":\"#dfe2ee\",\"tertiary_fixed_dim\":\"#7bd0ff\",\"primary\":\"#6dffb1\",\"secondary\":\"#f5fff2\",\"surface\":\"#0f131c\",\"on_error\":\"#690005\",\"on_primary_fixed\":\"#002110\",\"surface_dim\":\"#0f131c\",\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\":\"#005227\",\"secondary_fixed_dim\":\"#00e476\",\"on_tertiary_fixed\":\"#001e2c\",\"outline\":\"#849588\",\"outline_variant\":\"#3b4a3f\",\"on_primary\":\"#003920\",\"primary_fixed_dim\":\"#00e38d\",\"secondary_container\":\"#36ff8b\",\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\":\"#004c69\",\"on_tertiary_container\":\"#005a7b\",\"surface_variant\":\"#31353e\",\"surface_bright\":\"#353942\",\"inverse_primary\":\"#006d41\",\"surface_container_highest\":\"#31353e\",\"surface_tint\":\"#00e38d\",\"on_surface_variant\":\"#bacbbd\",\"on_background\":\"#dfe2ee\",\"background\":\"#0f131c\",\"tertiary_container\":\"#82d2ff\",\"on_error_container\":\"#ffdad6\",\"on_primary_fixed_variant\":\"#005230\",\"tertiary_fixed\":\"#c4e7ff\",\"on_tertiary\":\"#00354a\",\"on_surface\":\"#dfe2ee\",\"surface_container_lowest\":\"#0a0e16\",\"on_primary_container\":\"#006139\",\"on_secondary_container\":\"#007238\",\"tertiary\":\"#c9e9ff\",\"secondary_fixed\":\"#61ff97\",\"on_secondary\":\"#003919\",\"primary_container\":\"#00e58f\",\"error\":\"#ffb4ab\",\"error_container\":\"#93000a\",\"surface_container\":\"#1c2028\",\"primary_fixed\":\"#54ffaa\",\"surface_container_low\":\"#181c24\"},\"designMd\":\"---\\nname: Obsidian Cyber-Shield\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#0f131c'\\n  surface-dim: '#0f131c'\\n  surface-bright: '#353942'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#0a0e16'\\n  surface-container-low: '#181c24'\\n  surface-container: '#1c2028'\\n  surface-container-high: '#262a33'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#31353e'\\n  on-surface: '#dfe2ee'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#bacbbd'\\n  inverse-surface: '#dfe2ee'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#2c3039'\\n  outline: '#849588'\\n  outline-variant: '#3b4a3f'\\n  surface-tint: '#00e38d'\\n  primary: '#6dffb1'\\n  on-primary: '#003920'\\n  primary-container: '#00e58f'\\n  on-primary-container: '#006139'\\n  inverse-primary: '#006d41'\\n  secondary: '#f5fff2'\\n  on-secondary: '#003919'\\n  secondary-container: '#36ff8b'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#007238'\\n  tertiary: '#c9e9ff'\\n  on-tertiary: '#00354a'\\n  tertiary-container: '#82d2ff'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#005a7b'\\n  error: '#ffb4ab'\\n  on-error: '#690005'\\n  error-container: '#93000a'\\n  on-error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  primary-fixed: '#54ffaa'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#00e38d'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#002110'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#005230'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#61ff97'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#00e476'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#00210c'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#005227'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#c4e7ff'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#7bd0ff'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#001e2c'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#004c69'\\n  background: '#0f131c'\\n  on-background: '#dfe2ee'\\n  surface-variant: '#31353e'\\ntypography:\\n  display-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 36px\\n    fontWeight: '800'\\n    lineHeight: 44px\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-md:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 30px\\n    fontWeight: '800'\\n    lineHeight: 38px\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 28px\\n    fontWeight: '700'\\n    lineHeight: 36px\\n    letterSpacing: -0.01em\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 24px\\n    fontWeight: '700'\\n    lineHeight: 32px\\n    letterSpacing: -0.01em\\n  title-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 22px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 28px\\n  title-md:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 18px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 24px\\n  title-sm:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 22px\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: 24px\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: 20px\\n  label-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 20px\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  label-md:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 13px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: 18px\\n  label-sm:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: 16px\\n    letterSpacing: 0.02em\\n  metric-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 34px\\n    fontWeight: '700'\\n    lineHeight: 40px\\n    letterSpacing: -0.03em\\n  metric-md:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 24px\\n    fontWeight: '700'\\n    lineHeight: 30px\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  gutter: 1rem\\n  gutter-tablet: 1.5rem\\n  gutter-desktop: 2rem\\n  margin: 1rem\\n  margin-tablet: 2rem\\n  margin-desktop: 3rem\\n  space-xs: 0.25rem\\n  space-sm: 0.5rem\\n  space-md: 1rem\\n  space-lg: 1.5rem\\n  space-xl: 2rem\\n---\\n\\n## Brand & Style\\nThis design system adapts Material Design 3 Expressive for high-security consumer networking and privacy software. It blends deep obsidian surfaces with electric cybernetic illumination, projecting impregnable operational defense, near-zero latency, and military-grade telemetry. \\n\\nThe aesthetic synthesizes:\\n- **Glassmorphic Obsidian**: Multi-tiered semi-translucent dark surfaces featuring back-layer diffusion, fine boundary highlights, and disciplined contrast.\\n- **Bioluminescent Accents**: Electric emerald and neon mint glows that function as authoritative indicators of cryptographic connection states.\\n- **Cyber-Precision Telemetry**: Monospace tabular metrics paired with soft, rounded typography to balance technical credibility with consumer approachability.\\n\\nThe emotional signature is calming invulnerability: users transition from raw, exposed network environments into an encrypted, monitored enclosure.\\n\\n## Colors\\nThe palette uses functional radiance atop pure dark substrates. Pure black is avoided in favor of Obsidian Black (`#0B0F17`) to prevent OLED smear and preserve subtle ambient shadows.\\n\\n### Surface System\\n- **Main Background**: `#0B0F17` (Canvas foundation)\\n- **Elevated Background**: `#101722` (Modals, bottom sheets, secondary overlays)\\n- **Primary Card Surface**: `#141B26` (Standard containment cards, metric groups)\\n- **Secondary Card Surface**: `#1E2638` (Interactive items inside containers, active selections)\\n- **Glass Border Stroke**: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)` (Uniform 1px edge boundary)\\n\\n### Chromatic Roles\\n- **Primary Accent (`#00E58F`)**: Electric emerald for secure states, primary interactive triggers, and core encryption halos.\\n- **Highlight Accent (`#00FF85`)**: Neon mint for high-energy telemetry pings, live packet animations, and key callout states.\\n- **Telemetry Cyan (`#38BDF8`)**: Downstream/upstream throughput readouts, IP details, and protocol badges.\\n- **Warning Amber (`#FFBC5E`)**: Unsecured Wi-Fi alerts, latency bottlenecks, and server load warnings (\\u003e80%).\\n- **Critical / Disconnected (`#FF6178`)**: Kill switch activations, dropped tunnels, and unencrypted risk warnings.\\n\\n### Typography & Contrast\\n- **High-Emphasis Text**: `#FFFFFF` (Primary titles, essential status headers)\\n- **Medium-Emphasis Text**: `#B3BAC5` (Explanatory body text, active parameter values)\\n- **Low-Emphasis / Disabled**: `#737C8C` (Protocol versions, inactive headers, timestamp metadata)\\n\\n## Typography\\nPlus Jakarta Sans provides high legibility on dark glass surfaces through open apertures, large x-height, and clean geometric forms.\\n\\n- **Numerics & Telemetry**: `metric-lg` and `metric-md` must be rendered with OpenType tabular figures (`font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;`) to prevent layout shifts during live ping, throughput, and IP metric updates.\\n- **Hierarchy Scale**:\\n  - `display-lg` / `display-md`: Large landing titles and dashboard encryption states (\\\"PROTECTED\\\", \\\"DISCONNECTED\\\").\\n  - `headline-lg` / `headline-md`: Modal headers and configuration screens.\\n  - `title-lg` / `title-md`: Connection status headers and selected server region names.\\n  - `title-sm`: Card-level titles and parameter groupings.\\n  - `body-lg` / `body-md`: Standard functional descriptions and protocol configuration body copy.\\n  - `label-sm` / `label-md`: System metadata, timestamp readings, security hash previews, and secondary labels.\\n\\n## Layout & Spacing\\nThe layout system uses an 8dp baseline grid (with 4dp sub-increments for dense data points), structured around full-width responsive containment zones.\\n\\n- **Grid Architecture**:\\n  - **Mobile (\\u003c600dp)**: 4 fluid columns, 16dp margins, 16dp gutters. Single-column stacked cards.\\n  - **Tablet (600–1024dp)**: 8 fluid columns, 32dp margins, 24dp gutters. Two-column layout split between earth wireframe telemetry and server configuration.\\n  - **Desktop (\\u003e1024dp)**: 12 fluid columns, 48dp margins, 32dp gutters with a max canvas width of 1440dp.\\n- **Rhythm & Safe Areas**:\\n  - Top canvas maintains 16dp spacing below system status bars.\\n  - Bottom edge incorporates an 88dp clearance offset to float the bottom navigation dock without obscuring interactive controls.\\n- **Density**: Cards use 16dp to 24dp internal padding (`space-md` to `space-lg`), keeping compact layouts readable.\\n\\n## Elevation & Depth\\nDepth is built with tinted ambient glows and translucent glass layering rather than traditional drop shadows.\\n\\n- **Base Canvas**: Pure `#0B0F17`, no elevation.\\n- **Surface Elevation 1 (Cards)**:\\n  - Fill: `#141B26` at 85% opacity with `backdrop-filter: blur(20px)`.\\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`.\\n  - Ambient Glow: Soft bottom glow (`0px 12px 32px -8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)`).\\n- **Surface Elevation 2 (Active/Connected Cards)**:\\n  - Fill: `#1E2638` at 90% opacity with `backdrop-filter: blur(24px)`.\\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.3)`.\\n  - Ambient Glow: `0px 8px 30px rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.12)`, producing an emerald aura around the active server.\\n- **Surface Elevation 3 (Floating Nav Dock & Modals)**:\\n  - Fill: `#101722` at 80% opacity with `backdrop-filter: blur(28px)`.\\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12)`.\\n  - Ambient Shadow: `0px 20px 40px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8)`.\\n\\n## Shapes\\nFollowing Material Design 3 Expressive principles, container shapes balance geometric structure with friendly, ergonomic corners.\\n\\n- **Primary & Secondary Cards**: 24dp corner radii (`rounded-xl` variant override).\\n- **Floating Bottom Navigation Dock**: 28dp capsule radius for a smooth floating pill shape.\\n- **Interactive Action Triggers (CTAs)**: Full capsule/pill radius (9999dp) or 24dp corner radius.\\n- **Input Fields & Quick Selectors**: 16dp corner radius (`rounded-lg`).\\n- **Telemetry Badges & Minor Chips**: 8dp to 12dp corner radius (`rounded-md`).\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Hero Connection Controller\\n- The primary connection module features an interactive multi-ring component enclosing a holographic 3D wireframe Earth.\\n- **Disconnected State**: Rings render in `#1E2638` with static 1px borders; central power glyph tinted `#737C8C`.\\n- **Connected State**: Rings render in `#00E58F` with an outer pulsing halo (`0 0 40px rgba(0, 255, 133, 0.35)`). A subtle rotational radar sweep runs at 0.5Hz.\\n- Touch target: minimum 120dp circular area with 48dp minimum internal strike-zone.\\n\\n### Buttons & Interactive CTAs\\n- **Primary Glowing CTA**: \\n  - Height: 56dp (touch safe).\\n  - Background: Gradient from `#00E58F` to `#00FF85`.\\n  - Text: `#0B0F17` in `label-lg` ExtraBold.\\n  - Box Shadow: `0 4px 20px rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.4)`.\\n  - Hover/Active: Translates to a scale of 0.98; brightness increases by 10%.\\n- **Secondary Ghost Button**:\\n  - Height: 48dp.\\n  - Background: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04)`.\\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12)`.\\n  - Text: `#FFFFFF` in `label-lg` SemiBold.\\n\\n### Floating Bottom Navigation Dock\\n- Height: 64dp, margin: 16dp horizontal, floating 24dp above device edge.\\n- Radius: 28dp, fill: `#101722` at 85% opacity with 24px blur.\\n- Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`.\\n- Active Icon: Highlighted with an emerald indicator pill (`rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.15)`) with an icon color of `#00E58F`.\\n- Minimum tap target for each tab: 48dp × 48dp.\\n\\n### Cards & Telemetry Containers\\n- **Server Selection Tile**: \\n  - Height: 72dp.\\n  - Background: `#141B26` with 24dp radius and 1px `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)` border.\\n  - Country flag indicator, server location in `title-sm`, ping latency badge in `#38BDF8`.\\n  - Active state triggers a 1px border of `#00E58F` with 8% emerald fill tint.\\n- **Live Metrics Card**:\\n  - Two-column card showing upstream and downstream speeds.\\n  - Download: Cyan (`#38BDF8`) glyph with `metric-md` numeric counter.\\n  - Upload: Neon Mint (`#00FF85`) glyph with `metric-md` numeric counter.\\n\\n### Switches, Toggles & Checkboxes\\n- **MD3 Expressive Switch**:\\n  - Track: 52dp width × 32dp height, fully rounded pill. Unchecked track `#1E2638`; checked track `#00E58F`.\\n  - Thumb: 24dp circle. Unchecked `#737C8C`; checked `#0B0F17`.\\n  - Integrated with haptic feedback tick upon state change.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- Height: 56dp.\\n- Fill: `#141B26`, border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)`. Radius: 16dp.\\n- Focused State: Border changes to 1.5px solid `#00E58F` with `box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.2)`.\",\"colorVariant\":\"FIDELITY\",\"overridePrimaryColor\":\"#00e58f\",\"overrideSecondaryColor\":\"#00ff85\",\"overrideTertiaryColor\":\"#38bdf8\",\"overrideNeutralColor\":\"#0b0f17\",\"spacingScale\":2,\"typography\":{\"headline-lg\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"28px\",\"fontWeight\":\"700\",\"lineHeight\":\"36px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.01em\"},\"display-lg\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"36px\",\"fontWeight\":\"800\",\"lineHeight\":\"44px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.02em\"},\"label-md\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"13px\",\"fontWeight\":\"400\",\"lineHeight\":\"18px\"},\"metric-md\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"24px\",\"fontWeight\":\"700\",\"lineHeight\":\"30px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.02em\"},\"title-lg\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"22px\",\"fontWeight\":\"600\",\"lineHeight\":\"28px\"},\"headline-md\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"24px\",\"fontWeight\":\"700\",\"lineHeight\":\"32px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.01em\"},\"body-lg\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"16px\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\",\"lineHeight\":\"24px\"},\"body-md\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"14px\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\",\"lineHeight\":\"20px\"},\"label-lg\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"14px\",\"fontWeight\":\"600\",\"lineHeight\":\"20px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0.01em\"},\"title-sm\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"16px\",\"fontWeight\":\"600\",\"lineHeight\":\"22px\"},\"metric-lg\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"34px\",\"fontWeight\":\"700\",\"lineHeight\":\"40px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.03em\"},\"label-sm\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"12px\",\"fontWeight\":\"400\",\"lineHeight\":\"16px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0.02em\"},\"title-md\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"18px\",\"fontWeight\":\"600\",\"lineHeight\":\"24px\"},\"display-md\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"30px\",\"fontWeight\":\"800\",\"lineHeight\":\"38px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.02em\"}},\"spacing\":{\"space-xs\":\"0.25rem\",\"margin-desktop\":\"3rem\",\"space-lg\":\"1.5rem\",\"space-md\":\"1rem\",\"gutter-tablet\":\"1.5rem\",\"space-xl\":\"2rem\",\"space-sm\":\"0.5rem\",\"margin-tablet\":\"2rem\",\"gutter-desktop\":\"2rem\",\"margin\":\"1rem\",\"gutter\":\"1rem\"},\"headlineFontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"bodyFontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"labelFontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\"},\"manifestJson\":\"{\\\"source\\\":\\\"harness\\\",\\\"version\\\":1,\\\"identity\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Obsidian Cyber-Shield\\\"},\\\"isGeneratingComponents\\\":false,\\\"designMd\\\":\\\"---\\\\nname: Obsidian Cyber-Shield\\\\ncolors:\\\\n  surface: '#0f131c'\\\\n  surface-dim: '#0f131c'\\\\n  surface-bright: '#353942'\\\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#0a0e16'\\\\n  surface-container-low: '#181c24'\\\\n  surface-container: '#1c2028'\\\\n  surface-container-high: '#262a33'\\\\n  surface-container-highest: '#31353e'\\\\n  on-surface: '#dfe2ee'\\\\n  on-surface-variant: '#bacbbd'\\\\n  inverse-surface: '#dfe2ee'\\\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#2c3039'\\\\n  outline: '#849588'\\\\n  outline-variant: '#3b4a3f'\\\\n  surface-tint: '#00e38d'\\\\n  primary: '#6dffb1'\\\\n  on-primary: '#003920'\\\\n  primary-container: '#00e58f'\\\\n  on-primary-container: '#006139'\\\\n  inverse-primary: '#006d41'\\\\n  secondary: '#f5fff2'\\\\n  on-secondary: '#003919'\\\\n  secondary-container: '#36ff8b'\\\\n  on-secondary-container: '#007238'\\\\n  tertiary: '#c9e9ff'\\\\n  on-tertiary: '#00354a'\\\\n  tertiary-container: '#82d2ff'\\\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#005a7b'\\\\n  error: '#ffb4ab'\\\\n  on-error: '#690005'\\\\n  error-container: '#93000a'\\\\n  on-error-container: '#ffdad6'\\\\n  primary-fixed: '#54ffaa'\\\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#00e38d'\\\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#002110'\\\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#005230'\\\\n  secondary-fixed: '#61ff97'\\\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#00e476'\\\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#00210c'\\\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#005227'\\\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#c4e7ff'\\\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#7bd0ff'\\\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#001e2c'\\\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#004c69'\\\\n  background: '#0f131c'\\\\n  on-background: '#dfe2ee'\\\\n  surface-variant: '#31353e'\\\\ntypography:\\\\n  display-lg:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 36px\\\\n    fontWeight: '800'\\\\n    lineHeight: 44px\\\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\\\n  display-md:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 30px\\\\n    fontWeight: '800'\\\\n    lineHeight: 38px\\\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\\\n  headline-lg:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 28px\\\\n    fontWeight: '700'\\\\n    lineHeight: 36px\\\\n    letterSpacing: -0.01em\\\\n  headline-md:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 24px\\\\n    fontWeight: '700'\\\\n    lineHeight: 32px\\\\n    letterSpacing: -0.01em\\\\n  title-lg:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 22px\\\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\\\n    lineHeight: 28px\\\\n  title-md:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 18px\\\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\\\n    lineHeight: 24px\\\\n  title-sm:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 16px\\\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\\\n    lineHeight: 22px\\\\n  body-lg:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 16px\\\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\\\n    lineHeight: 24px\\\\n  body-md:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 14px\\\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\\\n    lineHeight: 20px\\\\n  label-lg:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 14px\\\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\\\n    lineHeight: 20px\\\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\\\n  label-md:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 13px\\\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\\\n    lineHeight: 18px\\\\n  label-sm:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 12px\\\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\\\n    lineHeight: 16px\\\\n    letterSpacing: 0.02em\\\\n  metric-lg:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 34px\\\\n    fontWeight: '700'\\\\n    lineHeight: 40px\\\\n    letterSpacing: -0.03em\\\\n  metric-md:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 24px\\\\n    fontWeight: '700'\\\\n    lineHeight: 30px\\\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\\\nrounded:\\\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\\\n  md: 0.75rem\\\\n  lg: 1rem\\\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\\\n  full: 9999px\\\\nspacing:\\\\n  gutter: 1rem\\\\n  gutter-tablet: 1.5rem\\\\n  gutter-desktop: 2rem\\\\n  margin: 1rem\\\\n  margin-tablet: 2rem\\\\n  margin-desktop: 3rem\\\\n  space-xs: 0.25rem\\\\n  space-sm: 0.5rem\\\\n  space-md: 1rem\\\\n  space-lg: 1.5rem\\\\n  space-xl: 2rem\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## Brand & Style\\\\nThis design system adapts Material Design 3 Expressive for high-security consumer networking and privacy software. It blends deep obsidian surfaces with electric cybernetic illumination, projecting impregnable operational defense, near-zero latency, and military-grade telemetry. \\\\n\\\\nThe aesthetic synthesizes:\\\\n- **Glassmorphic Obsidian**: Multi-tiered semi-translucent dark surfaces featuring back-layer diffusion, fine boundary highlights, and disciplined contrast.\\\\n- **Bioluminescent Accents**: Electric emerald and neon mint glows that function as authoritative indicators of cryptographic connection states.\\\\n- **Cyber-Precision Telemetry**: Monospace tabular metrics paired with soft, rounded typography to balance technical credibility with consumer approachability.\\\\n\\\\nThe emotional signature is calming invulnerability: users transition from raw, exposed network environments into an encrypted, monitored enclosure.\\\\n\\\\n## Colors\\\\nThe palette uses functional radiance atop pure dark substrates. Pure black is avoided in favor of Obsidian Black (`#0B0F17`) to prevent OLED smear and preserve subtle ambient shadows.\\\\n\\\\n### Surface System\\\\n- **Main Background**: `#0B0F17` (Canvas foundation)\\\\n- **Elevated Background**: `#101722` (Modals, bottom sheets, secondary overlays)\\\\n- **Primary Card Surface**: `#141B26` (Standard containment cards, metric groups)\\\\n- **Secondary Card Surface**: `#1E2638` (Interactive items inside containers, active selections)\\\\n- **Glass Border Stroke**: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)` (Uniform 1px edge boundary)\\\\n\\\\n### Chromatic Roles\\\\n- **Primary Accent (`#00E58F`)**: Electric emerald for secure states, primary interactive triggers, and core encryption halos.\\\\n- **Highlight Accent (`#00FF85`)**: Neon mint for high-energy telemetry pings, live packet animations, and key callout states.\\\\n- **Telemetry Cyan (`#38BDF8`)**: Downstream/upstream throughput readouts, IP details, and protocol badges.\\\\n- **Warning Amber (`#FFBC5E`)**: Unsecured Wi-Fi alerts, latency bottlenecks, and server load warnings (\\\\u003e80%).\\\\n- **Critical / Disconnected (`#FF6178`)**: Kill switch activations, dropped tunnels, and unencrypted risk warnings.\\\\n\\\\n### Typography & Contrast\\\\n- **High-Emphasis Text**: `#FFFFFF` (Primary titles, essential status headers)\\\\n- **Medium-Emphasis Text**: `#B3BAC5` (Explanatory body text, active parameter values)\\\\n- **Low-Emphasis / Disabled**: `#737C8C` (Protocol versions, inactive headers, timestamp metadata)\\\\n\\\\n## Typography\\\\nPlus Jakarta Sans provides high legibility on dark glass surfaces through open apertures, large x-height, and clean geometric forms.\\\\n\\\\n- **Numerics & Telemetry**: `metric-lg` and `metric-md` must be rendered with OpenType tabular figures (`font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;`) to prevent layout shifts during live ping, throughput, and IP metric updates.\\\\n- **Hierarchy Scale**:\\\\n  - `display-lg` / `display-md`: Large landing titles and dashboard encryption states (\\\\\\\"PROTECTED\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"DISCONNECTED\\\\\\\").\\\\n  - `headline-lg` / `headline-md`: Modal headers and configuration screens.\\\\n  - `title-lg` / `title-md`: Connection status headers and selected server region names.\\\\n  - `title-sm`: Card-level titles and parameter groupings.\\\\n  - `body-lg` / `body-md`: Standard functional descriptions and protocol configuration body copy.\\\\n  - `label-sm` / `label-md`: System metadata, timestamp readings, security hash previews, and secondary labels.\\\\n\\\\n## Layout & Spacing\\\\nThe layout system uses an 8dp baseline grid (with 4dp sub-increments for dense data points), structured around full-width responsive containment zones.\\\\n\\\\n- **Grid Architecture**:\\\\n  - **Mobile (\\\\u003c600dp)**: 4 fluid columns, 16dp margins, 16dp gutters. Single-column stacked cards.\\\\n  - **Tablet (600–1024dp)**: 8 fluid columns, 32dp margins, 24dp gutters. Two-column layout split between earth wireframe telemetry and server configuration.\\\\n  - **Desktop (\\\\u003e1024dp)**: 12 fluid columns, 48dp margins, 32dp gutters with a max canvas width of 1440dp.\\\\n- **Rhythm & Safe Areas**:\\\\n  - Top canvas maintains 16dp spacing below system status bars.\\\\n  - Bottom edge incorporates an 88dp clearance offset to float the bottom navigation dock without obscuring interactive controls.\\\\n- **Density**: Cards use 16dp to 24dp internal padding (`space-md` to `space-lg`), keeping compact layouts readable.\\\\n\\\\n## Elevation & Depth\\\\nDepth is built with tinted ambient glows and translucent glass layering rather than traditional drop shadows.\\\\n\\\\n- **Base Canvas**: Pure `#0B0F17`, no elevation.\\\\n- **Surface Elevation 1 (Cards)**:\\\\n  - Fill: `#141B26` at 85% opacity with `backdrop-filter: blur(20px)`.\\\\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`.\\\\n  - Ambient Glow: Soft bottom glow (`0px 12px 32px -8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)`).\\\\n- **Surface Elevation 2 (Active/Connected Cards)**:\\\\n  - Fill: `#1E2638` at 90% opacity with `backdrop-filter: blur(24px)`.\\\\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.3)`.\\\\n  - Ambient Glow: `0px 8px 30px rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.12)`, producing an emerald aura around the active server.\\\\n- **Surface Elevation 3 (Floating Nav Dock & Modals)**:\\\\n  - Fill: `#101722` at 80% opacity with `backdrop-filter: blur(28px)`.\\\\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12)`.\\\\n  - Ambient Shadow: `0px 20px 40px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8)`.\\\\n\\\\n## Shapes\\\\nFollowing Material Design 3 Expressive principles, container shapes balance geometric structure with friendly, ergonomic corners.\\\\n\\\\n- **Primary & Secondary Cards**: 24dp corner radii (`rounded-xl` variant override).\\\\n- **Floating Bottom Navigation Dock**: 28dp capsule radius for a smooth floating pill shape.\\\\n- **Interactive Action Triggers (CTAs)**: Full capsule/pill radius (9999dp) or 24dp corner radius.\\\\n- **Input Fields & Quick Selectors**: 16dp corner radius (`rounded-lg`).\\\\n- **Telemetry Badges & Minor Chips**: 8dp to 12dp corner radius (`rounded-md`).\\\\n\\\\n## Components\\\\n\\\\n### Hero Connection Controller\\\\n- The primary connection module features an interactive multi-ring component enclosing a holographic 3D wireframe Earth.\\\\n- **Disconnected State**: Rings render in `#1E2638` with static 1px borders; central power glyph tinted `#737C8C`.\\\\n- **Connected State**: Rings render in `#00E58F` with an outer pulsing halo (`0 0 40px rgba(0, 255, 133, 0.35)`). A subtle rotational radar sweep runs at 0.5Hz.\\\\n- Touch target: minimum 120dp circular area with 48dp minimum internal strike-zone.\\\\n\\\\n### Buttons & Interactive CTAs\\\\n- **Primary Glowing CTA**: \\\\n  - Height: 56dp (touch safe).\\\\n  - Background: Gradient from `#00E58F` to `#00FF85`.\\\\n  - Text: `#0B0F17` in `label-lg` ExtraBold.\\\\n  - Box Shadow: `0 4px 20px rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.4)`.\\\\n  - Hover/Active: Translates to a scale of 0.98; brightness increases by 10%.\\\\n- **Secondary Ghost Button**:\\\\n  - Height: 48dp.\\\\n  - Background: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04)`.\\\\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12)`.\\\\n  - Text: `#FFFFFF` in `label-lg` SemiBold.\\\\n\\\\n### Floating Bottom Navigation Dock\\\\n- Height: 64dp, margin: 16dp horizontal, floating 24dp above device edge.\\\\n- Radius: 28dp, fill: `#101722` at 85% opacity with 24px blur.\\\\n- Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`.\\\\n- Active Icon: Highlighted with an emerald indicator pill (`rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.15)`) with an icon color of `#00E58F`.\\\\n- Minimum tap target for each tab: 48dp × 48dp.\\\\n\\\\n### Cards & Telemetry Containers\\\\n- **Server Selection Tile**: \\\\n  - Height: 72dp.\\\\n  - Background: `#141B26` with 24dp radius and 1px `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)` border.\\\\n  - Country flag indicator, server location in `title-sm`, ping latency badge in `#38BDF8`.\\\\n  - Active state triggers a 1px border of `#00E58F` with 8% emerald fill tint.\\\\n- **Live Metrics Card**:\\\\n  - Two-column card showing upstream and downstream speeds.\\\\n  - Download: Cyan (`#38BDF8`) glyph with `metric-md` numeric counter.\\\\n  - Upload: Neon Mint (`#00FF85`) glyph with `metric-md` numeric counter.\\\\n\\\\n### Switches, Toggles & Checkboxes\\\\n- **MD3 Expressive Switch**:\\\\n  - Track: 52dp width × 32dp height, fully rounded pill. Unchecked track `#1E2638`; checked track `#00E58F`.\\\\n  - Thumb: 24dp circle. Unchecked `#737C8C`; checked `#0B0F17`.\\\\n  - Integrated with haptic feedback tick upon state change.\\\\n\\\\n### Input Fields\\\\n- Height: 56dp.\\\\n- Fill: `#141B26`, border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)`. Radius: 16dp.\\\\n- Focused State: Border changes to 1.5px solid `#00E58F` with `box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.2)`.\\\",\\\"tokens\\\":{\\\"radius\\\":[{\\\"value\\\":\\\"1rem\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"lg\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"lg\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"full\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"9999px\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"full\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"0.25rem\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"sm\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"sm\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEFAULT\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"DEFAULT\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"8px\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"1.5rem\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"xl\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"xl\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"0.75rem\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"md\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"md\\\"}],\\\"colors\\\":[{\\\"role\\\":\\\"neutral\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Neutral\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"neutral\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#0b0f17\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Tertiary Container\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#82d2ff\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"tertiary-container\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"tertiary-container\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#005a7b\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"primary-fixed\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"primary-fixed\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#002110\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#54ffaa\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Primary Fixed\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"#0f131c\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"surface-dim\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"surface-dim\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surface Dim\\\"},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"surface-container-low\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surface Container Low\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"surface-container-low\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#181c24\\\"},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"outline\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#849588\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Outline\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"outline\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"#006d41\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"inverse-primary\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"inverse-primary\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Inverse Primary\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"tertiary-fixed-dim\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"tertiary-fixed-dim\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#7bd0ff\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Tertiary Fixed Dim\\\"},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"surface-bright\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surface Bright\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#353942\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"surface-bright\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"#6dffb1\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#003920\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"primary\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Primary\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"primary\\\"},{\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#ffdad6\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"error-container\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Error Container\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#93000a\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"error-container\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"#1c2028\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"surface-container\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surface Container\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"surface-container\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"surface\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surface\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#0f131c\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#dfe2ee\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"surface\\\"},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"outline-variant\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Outline Variant\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#3b4a3f\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"outline-variant\\\"},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"inverse-on-surface\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#2c3039\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Inverse On Surface\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"inverse-on-surface\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Secondary Fixed\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#61ff97\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"secondary-fixed\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"secondary-fixed\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#00210c\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"#00e58f\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"primary-container\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"primary-container\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Primary Container\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#006139\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"secondary-fixed-dim\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"secondary-fixed-dim\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Secondary Fixed Dim\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#00e476\\\"},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"surface-container-high\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surface Container High\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"surface-container-high\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#262a33\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"#00e38d\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"surface-tint\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surface Tint\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"surface-tint\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"#00e38d\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"primary-fixed-dim\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Primary Fixed Dim\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"primary-fixed-dim\\\"},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"tertiary-fixed\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#001e2c\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#c4e7ff\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Tertiary Fixed\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"tertiary-fixed\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"surface-variant\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"surface-variant\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#31353e\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surface Variant\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#bacbbd\\\"},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"surface-container-highest\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surface Container Highest\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#31353e\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"surface-container-highest\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"#dfe2ee\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"inverse-surface\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Inverse Surface\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"inverse-surface\\\"},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"surface-container-lowest\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surface Container Lowest\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#0a0e16\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"surface-container-lowest\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"background\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#dfe2ee\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"background\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#0f131c\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Background\\\"},{\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#00354a\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#c9e9ff\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"tertiary\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"tertiary\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Tertiary\\\"},{\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#690005\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"error\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#ffb4ab\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Error\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"error\\\"},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"secondary-container\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"secondary-container\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#36ff8b\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Secondary Container\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#007238\\\"},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"secondary\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#003919\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"secondary\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Secondary\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#f5fff2\\\"}],\\\"type\\\":[{\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"-0.01em\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Headline MD\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"24px\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"32px\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"700\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"headline-md\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Title MD\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"18px\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"title-md\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"24px\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"600\\\"},{\\\"weight\\\":\\\"400\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"label-sm\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Label SM\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"12px\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"16px\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"0.02em\\\"},{\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"-0.01em\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"headline-lg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Headline LG\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"28px\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"36px\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"700\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"label-lg\\\",\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"0.01em\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"20px\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"600\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Label LG\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"14px\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"metric-lg\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Metric LG\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"34px\\\",\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"-0.03em\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"40px\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"700\\\"},{\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"22px\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Title SM\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"16px\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"600\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"title-sm\\\"},{\\\"weight\\\":\\\"500\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"body-lg\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"24px\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Body LG\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"16px\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"body-md\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"20px\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"500\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Body MD\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"14px\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"display-md\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"800\\\",\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"-0.02em\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"38px\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Display MD\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"30px\\\"},{\\\"weight\\\":\\\"600\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"title-lg\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"28px\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Title LG\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"22px\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"label-md\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"18px\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"400\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Label MD\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"13px\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Metric MD\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"24px\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"metric-md\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"30px\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"700\\\",\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"-0.02em\\\"},{\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"-0.02em\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Display LG\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"36px\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"display-lg\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"44px\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"800\\\"}],\\\"surface\\\":{\\\"light\\\":{\\\"outline\\\":\\\"#3b4a3f\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#dfe2ee\\\",\\\"surface\\\":\\\"#1c2028\\\",\\\"background\\\":\\\"#0f131c\\\",\\\"onSurface\\\":\\\"#bacbbd\\\"},\\\"dark\\\":{\\\"onSurface\\\":\\\"#bacbbd\\\",\\\"outline\\\":\\\"#3b4a3f\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#dfe2ee\\\",\\\"surface\\\":\\\"#1c2028\\\",\\\"background\\\":\\\"#0f131c\\\"}},\\\"spacing\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"space-md\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"1rem\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"space-md\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"1rem\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"margin\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"margin\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"space-xl\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"space-xl\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"2rem\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"gutter\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"gutter\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"1rem\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"space-sm\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"space-sm\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"0.5rem\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"3rem\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"margin-desktop\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"margin-desktop\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"space-xs\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"space-xs\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"0.25rem\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"1.5rem\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"space-lg\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"space-lg\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"2rem\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"gutter-desktop\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"gutter-desktop\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"margin-tablet\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"2rem\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"margin-tablet\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"1.5rem\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"gutter-tablet\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"gutter-tablet\\\"}]}}\"},\"version\":\"1\"},{\"name\":\"assets/b157359ff24d43079924fa8e44a3d27c\",\"designSystem\":{\"displayName\":\"Aura Kinetic Security\",\"styleGuidelines\":\"## Brand & Style\\n\\nThis design system translates next-generation mobile cybersecurity into an experience defined by calm confidence, intelligent protection, and fluid connectivity. Rather than relying on defensive alarmism or sterile utility, the interface projects an ambient shield: high-trust, unobtrusive during steady-state protection, yet dynamically expressive during transitions, threats, and state changes.\\n\\nRooted in an evolution of Material Design 3 Expressive, the aesthetic pairs disciplined, ergonomic Android architecture with luminous ambient indicators. Visual states leverage soft glowing halos, adaptive tonal surface containers, and organic pill-shaped touch surfaces. The interaction tone balances surgical privacy engineering with approachable simplicity for mobile-first workflows.\\n\\n## Layout & Spacing\\n\\nLayout geometry follows an 8dp structural grid, underpinned by a 4dp micro-grid for compact internal component spacing, badges, and icon pairings. All clickable targets strictly enforce a minimum touch target size of 48×48dp regardless of visual container boundary.\\n\\n- **Compact (Mobile: \\u003c 600dp):** Fluid single-column layout with 16dp (`margin`) screen edges and 16dp (`gutter`) card separation. Navigation utilizes an ergonomic bottom bar or expandable bottom sheet.\\n- **Medium (Tablet / Foldable unfolded: 600dp–839dp):** Dual-pane structure with 24dp screen padding and 32dp gutter. The primary pane houses connection controls and live status visualizations; the secondary pane houses server node directories and split-tunneling settings.\\n- **Expanded (Landscape / Large Screens: 840dp+):** Rail-based navigation with max-width content bounding containers set to 1040dp to prevent unwieldy scan lines on wide displays.\\n\\n## Elevation & Depth\\n\\nVisual hierarchy does not use sharp drop-shadows. Instead, elevation is achieved through a combination of M3 tonal layering, luminous halos, and low-contrast ghost outlines:\\n\\n1. **Surface Hierarchy (Tonal Stepping):** Depth is communicated through luminance progression. Base canvas rests on `Surface` (`#0F172A`). Resting cards sit on `Surface Container Low` (`#1E293B`). Lifted sheets, modals, and tooltips occupy `Surface Container High` (`#334155`).\\n2. **Halo Radiation (Active States):** The central connection node and active status chips project a dual-layer soft ambient glow rather than a standard shadow:\\n   - Primary Halo: `0 0 32px 0 rgba(102, 213, 255, 0.25)`\\n   - Intense Core Glow: `0 0 12px 2px rgba(102, 213, 255, 0.40)`\\n3. **Ghost Outlines:** Elevated surfaces are framed by a 1px border of `Outline` at 18% opacity, ensuring sharp separation between tonal tiers without heavy visual weight.\\n4. **Modal Elevation:** Full-screen dialogs and modal bottom sheets utilize a scrim overlay with a dynamic backdrop blur (`backdrop-filter: blur(16px)` with 60% opacity surface tint).\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Hero Connect Button (Central Action)\\n- **Geometry:** Large 96dp circle (idle) or pill form, centered within a multi-ringed 160dp canvas.\\n- **Resting (Disconnected):** Outlined border (2dp) in `Outline` over `Surface Container Low`, containing a neutral power icon.\\n- **Active (Connected):** Filled container in `Primary` with `On Primary` icon. Enclosed by two pulsating concentric halo rings animating subtly between 12dp and 24dp scale with 20% opacity.\\n- **Connecting:** Continuous smooth angular sweep gradient rotating along the perimeter with a 4dp stroke.\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Full pill (48dp height), background `Primary`, text `On Primary` (`label-lg`). Minimum width 120dp.\\n- **Tonal (Secondary):** Full pill (40dp height), background `Primary Container`, text `On Primary Container`.\\n- **Outlined:** 40dp pill, 1px border in `Outline` at 30% opacity, transparent background, text `Primary`.\\n- **Touch Target:** Internal padding at least 12dp horizontal, centered within 48dp absolute bounding box.\\n\\n### Chips (Protocol & Server Filters)\\n- **Height:** 32dp pill.\\n- **Unselected:** `Surface Container Low` with 1px border in `Outline` at 20% opacity. Text in `body-sm`.\\n- **Selected:** `Primary Container` with `On Primary Container` text, accompanied by a 16dp checkmark or active icon leading the label.\\n\\n### Server List Items\\n- **Structure:** 64dp vertical height card or continuous list item on `Surface Container Low`.\\n- **Content:** Left-aligned 28dp circular country flag avatar, followed by Server Name (`title-sm`) and City/IP (`body-sm`). Trailing block houses latency ping (color-coded badge: green `\\u003c50ms`, yellow `50–120ms`, red `\\u003e120ms`) and a favorite toggle.\\n- **Active Selection:** Bordered by a 1.5dp stroke of `Primary` with a soft 6% `Primary` surface tint.\\n\\n### Input Fields & Search Bars\\n- **Search Bar:** 48dp full pill, background `Surface Container High`, icon leading, clear action trailing. No border in resting state; 2dp `Primary` outline on focus.\\n- **Standard Text Fields:** 56dp height, rounded 16dp top and bottom corners, floating label architecture conforming to M3 specs. Background `Surface Container Low`.\\n\\n### Checkboxes, Radios, and Toggles\\n- **Switches (Kill Switch, Auto-Connect):** 32dp tall, 52dp wide pill track. Unchecked: track `Surface Container High`, thumb `Outline`. Checked: track `Primary`, thumb `On Primary` (thumb expands slightly on press).\\n- **Checkboxes:** 20×20dp box with 6dp corner radius. Checked fill `Primary` with `On Primary` check mark.\\n\\n### Telemetry / Traffic Cards\\n- **Geometry:** 24dp rounded rectangles using `Surface Container Low`.\\n- **Display:** Split-pane layout displaying Download/Upload live throughput with stylized sparklines drawn with a 2dp stroke in `Primary` and secondary muted teal. All numerical metrics use tabular figures (`title-lg`).\",\"theme\":{\"colorMode\":\"DARK\",\"font\":\"PLUS_JAKARTA_SANS\",\"roundness\":\"ROUND_FULL\",\"customColor\":\"#66d5ff\",\"headlineFont\":\"PLUS_JAKARTA_SANS\",\"bodyFont\":\"PLUS_JAKARTA_SANS\",\"labelFont\":\"PLUS_JAKARTA_SANS\",\"namedColors\":{\"tertiary_fixed_dim\":\"#9ecee2\",\"on_tertiary_container\":\"#29596b\",\"primary\":\"#bfebff\",\"inverse_on_surface\":\"#283044\",\"on_secondary_fixed\":\"#001f29\",\"on_tertiary\":\"#003544\",\"surface\":\"#0b1326\",\"on_secondary_fixed_variant\":\"#004d63\",\"surface_container_high\":\"#222a3d\",\"inverse_primary\":\"#006782\",\"surface_tint\":\"#64d3fd\",\"secondary_fixed\":\"#bce9ff\",\"on_primary\":\"#003545\",\"on_secondary\":\"#003545\",\"error_container\":\"#93000a\",\"on_error\":\"#690005\",\"primary_fixed_dim\":\"#64d3fd\",\"on_tertiary_fixed\":\"#001f29\",\"outline\":\"#879298\",\"surface_container_highest\":\"#2d3449\",\"on_tertiary_fixed_variant\":\"#194c5e\",\"surface_container_low\":\"#131b2e\",\"tertiary\":\"#bdebff\",\"background\":\"#0b1326\",\"on_primary_fixed\":\"#001f29\",\"tertiary_fixed\":\"#baeaff\",\"secondary\":\"#95cfe9\",\"tertiary_container\":\"#a0cfe3\",\"on_primary_container\":\"#005b74\",\"on_background\":\"#dae2fd\",\"surface_dim\":\"#0b1326\",\"error\":\"#ffb4ab\",\"on_surface_variant\":\"#bdc8ce\",\"inverse_surface\":\"#dae2fd\",\"primary_container\":\"#66d5ff\",\"surface_container\":\"#171f33\",\"outline_variant\":\"#3e484e\",\"on_secondary_container\":\"#84bdd7\",\"secondary_fixed_dim\":\"#95cfe9\",\"on_primary_fixed_variant\":\"#004d63\",\"surface_variant\":\"#2d3449\",\"surface_bright\":\"#31394d\",\"on_error_container\":\"#ffdad6\",\"secondary_container\":\"#004d63\",\"surface_container_lowest\":\"#060e20\",\"on_surface\":\"#dae2fd\",\"primary_fixed\":\"#bbe9ff\"},\"designMd\":\"---\\nname: Aura Kinetic Security\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#0b1326'\\n  surface-dim: '#0b1326'\\n  surface-bright: '#31394d'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#060e20'\\n  surface-container-low: '#131b2e'\\n  surface-container: '#171f33'\\n  surface-container-high: '#222a3d'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#2d3449'\\n  on-surface: '#dae2fd'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#bdc8ce'\\n  inverse-surface: '#dae2fd'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#283044'\\n  outline: '#879298'\\n  outline-variant: '#3e484e'\\n  surface-tint: '#64d3fd'\\n  primary: '#bfebff'\\n  on-primary: '#003545'\\n  primary-container: '#66d5ff'\\n  on-primary-container: '#005b74'\\n  inverse-primary: '#006782'\\n  secondary: '#95cfe9'\\n  on-secondary: '#003545'\\n  secondary-container: '#004d63'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#84bdd7'\\n  tertiary: '#bdebff'\\n  on-tertiary: '#003544'\\n  tertiary-container: '#a0cfe3'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#29596b'\\n  error: '#ffb4ab'\\n  on-error: '#690005'\\n  error-container: '#93000a'\\n  on-error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  primary-fixed: '#bbe9ff'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#64d3fd'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#001f29'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#004d63'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#bce9ff'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#95cfe9'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#001f29'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#004d63'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#baeaff'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#9ecee2'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#001f29'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#194c5e'\\n  background: '#0b1326'\\n  on-background: '#dae2fd'\\n  surface-variant: '#2d3449'\\ntypography:\\n  display-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 57px\\n    fontWeight: '700'\\n    lineHeight: 64px\\n    letterSpacing: -0.25px\\n  display-lg-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '700'\\n    lineHeight: 52px\\n    letterSpacing: -0.2px\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 40px\\n    letterSpacing: 0px\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 28px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 36px\\n    letterSpacing: 0px\\n  headline-sm:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 24px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 32px\\n    letterSpacing: 0px\\n  title-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 22px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: 28px\\n    letterSpacing: 0px\\n  title-md:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 24px\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15px\\n  title-sm:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 20px\\n    letterSpacing: 0.1px\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: 24px\\n    letterSpacing: 0.5px\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: 20px\\n    letterSpacing: 0.25px\\n  body-sm:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: 16px\\n    letterSpacing: 0.4px\\n  label-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 20px\\n    letterSpacing: 0.1px\\n  label-md:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 16px\\n    letterSpacing: 0.5px\\n  label-sm:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: 16px\\n    letterSpacing: 0.5px\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.5rem\\n  DEFAULT: 1rem\\n  md: 1.5rem\\n  lg: 2rem\\n  xl: 3rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  gutter: 1rem\\n  margin: 1rem\\n  gutter-tablet: 1.5rem\\n  margin-tablet: 2rem\\n  space-xs: 0.25rem\\n  space-sm: 0.5rem\\n  space-md: 1rem\\n  space-lg: 1.5rem\\n  space-xl: 2rem\\n---\\n\\n## Brand & Style\\n\\nThis design system translates next-generation mobile cybersecurity into an experience defined by calm confidence, intelligent protection, and fluid connectivity. Rather than relying on defensive alarmism or sterile utility, the interface projects an ambient shield: high-trust, unobtrusive during steady-state protection, yet dynamically expressive during transitions, threats, and state changes.\\n\\nRooted in an evolution of Material Design 3 Expressive, the aesthetic pairs disciplined, ergonomic Android architecture with luminous ambient indicators. Visual states leverage soft glowing halos, adaptive tonal surface containers, and organic pill-shaped touch surfaces. The interaction tone balances surgical privacy engineering with approachable simplicity for mobile-first workflows.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe system operates with `dark` as its primary default state, mirroring privacy-focused Android flagship applications and reducing OLED display power consumption during persistent background usage. \\n\\n### Dark Theme (Default)\\n- **Primary:** `#66D5FF` — Luminous cyber cyan/teal used for active protection indicators, primary FABs, and connected state signals.\\n- **On Primary:** `#003545` — Deep slate-teal providing high-contrast readability against glowing cyan controls.\\n- **Primary Container:** `#004D63` — Mid-tone cyan container applied to active server rows and selected segmented chips.\\n- **On Primary Container:** `#BAEAFF` — High-luminance accent tint for labels inside primary containers.\\n- **Surface:** `#0F172A` — Deep slate midnight canvas baseline.\\n- **Surface Container Low:** `#1E293B` — Resting cards, server list items, and metric groupings.\\n- **Surface Container High:** `#334155` — Elevated dialogs, active bottom sheets, and pressed states.\\n- **Outline:** `#8A9296` — Subtle boundary delineator calibrated for dark contrast compliance.\\n- **Error:** `#FFB4AB` — High-alert crimson tint for connection drops, kill switch triggers, and DNS leaks.\\n\\n### Light Theme\\n- **Primary:** `#006783` — Deep cyan for commanding actions, active toggles, and brand anchors.\\n- **On Primary:** `#FFFFFF` — Crisp optical white.\\n- **Primary Container:** `#BAEAFF` — Ice cyan background for activated utility blocks.\\n- **On Primary Container:** `#001F28` — Deepest midnight-teal text.\\n- **Surface:** `#F8FAFC` — Pure crisp backdrop.\\n- **Surface Container Low:** `#F1F5F9` — Primary grouping cards.\\n- **Surface Container High:** `#E2E8F0` — Modals, toolbars, and search bars.\\n- **Outline:** `#70787D` — Structural border definition.\\n- **Error:** `#BA1A1A` — High-visibility alert red.\\n\\nState layers apply an opacity overlay of the corresponding `on-*` color: Hover (8%), Focus (12%), Pressed (16%), and Dragged (20%).\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThe type system relies on `Plus Jakarta Sans` across all display, body, and label roles, using Android's system font as an immediate fallback. Its clean geometric curves and open counter forms ensure legibility at micro scales during status reporting (e.g., kilobits-per-second counters, IP addresses, latency graphs) while delivering a refined, modern tech presence on large display screens.\\n\\nNumbers in data counters, telemetry readouts, and throughput monitors must always enforce tabular figures (`font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums`) to prevent layout shifts during live ping and bandwidth fluctuations.\\n\\n## Layout & Spacing\\n\\nLayout geometry follows an 8dp structural grid, underpinned by a 4dp micro-grid for compact internal component spacing, badges, and icon pairings. All clickable targets strictly enforce a minimum touch target size of 48×48dp regardless of visual container boundary.\\n\\n- **Compact (Mobile: \\u003c 600dp):** Fluid single-column layout with 16dp (`margin`) screen edges and 16dp (`gutter`) card separation. Navigation utilizes an ergonomic bottom bar or expandable bottom sheet.\\n- **Medium (Tablet / Foldable unfolded: 600dp–839dp):** Dual-pane structure with 24dp screen padding and 32dp gutter. The primary pane houses connection controls and live status visualizations; the secondary pane houses server node directories and split-tunneling settings.\\n- **Expanded (Landscape / Large Screens: 840dp+):** Rail-based navigation with max-width content bounding containers set to 1040dp to prevent unwieldy scan lines on wide displays.\\n\\n## Elevation & Depth\\n\\nVisual hierarchy does not use sharp drop-shadows. Instead, elevation is achieved through a combination of M3 tonal layering, luminous halos, and low-contrast ghost outlines:\\n\\n1. **Surface Hierarchy (Tonal Stepping):** Depth is communicated through luminance progression. Base canvas rests on `Surface` (`#0F172A`). Resting cards sit on `Surface Container Low` (`#1E293B`). Lifted sheets, modals, and tooltips occupy `Surface Container High` (`#334155`).\\n2. **Halo Radiation (Active States):** The central connection node and active status chips project a dual-layer soft ambient glow rather than a standard shadow:\\n   - Primary Halo: `0 0 32px 0 rgba(102, 213, 255, 0.25)`\\n   - Intense Core Glow: `0 0 12px 2px rgba(102, 213, 255, 0.40)`\\n3. **Ghost Outlines:** Elevated surfaces are framed by a 1px border of `Outline` at 18% opacity, ensuring sharp separation between tonal tiers without heavy visual weight.\\n4. **Modal Elevation:** Full-screen dialogs and modal bottom sheets utilize a scrim overlay with a dynamic backdrop blur (`backdrop-filter: blur(16px)` with 60% opacity surface tint).\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe design system embraces an expressive corner philosophy, utilizing full pills for interaction touchpoints and soft rounded squircular forms for data containers:\\n\\n- **Full Pill (`9999px`):** Reserved for primary calls to action, the main connect toggle button, search input containers, chips, and navigation indicator pills.\\n- **Containers & Cards (`2rem` / 32px):** Applied to major dashboard panels, protocol configuration cards, and speed test containers.\\n- **Internal Nested Elements (`1rem` / 16px):** Used for nested sub-cards, server items within a grouped section, and secondary inputs.\\n- **Small Controls (`0.5rem` / 8px):** Checkboxes, status badges, and technical readouts.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Hero Connect Button (Central Action)\\n- **Geometry:** Large 96dp circle (idle) or pill form, centered within a multi-ringed 160dp canvas.\\n- **Resting (Disconnected):** Outlined border (2dp) in `Outline` over `Surface Container Low`, containing a neutral power icon.\\n- **Active (Connected):** Filled container in `Primary` with `On Primary` icon. Enclosed by two pulsating concentric halo rings animating subtly between 12dp and 24dp scale with 20% opacity.\\n- **Connecting:** Continuous smooth angular sweep gradient rotating along the perimeter with a 4dp stroke.\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Full pill (48dp height), background `Primary`, text `On Primary` (`label-lg`). Minimum width 120dp.\\n- **Tonal (Secondary):** Full pill (40dp height), background `Primary Container`, text `On Primary Container`.\\n- **Outlined:** 40dp pill, 1px border in `Outline` at 30% opacity, transparent background, text `Primary`.\\n- **Touch Target:** Internal padding at least 12dp horizontal, centered within 48dp absolute bounding box.\\n\\n### Chips (Protocol & Server Filters)\\n- **Height:** 32dp pill.\\n- **Unselected:** `Surface Container Low` with 1px border in `Outline` at 20% opacity. Text in `body-sm`.\\n- **Selected:** `Primary Container` with `On Primary Container` text, accompanied by a 16dp checkmark or active icon leading the label.\\n\\n### Server List Items\\n- **Structure:** 64dp vertical height card or continuous list item on `Surface Container Low`.\\n- **Content:** Left-aligned 28dp circular country flag avatar, followed by Server Name (`title-sm`) and City/IP (`body-sm`). Trailing block houses latency ping (color-coded badge: green `\\u003c50ms`, yellow `50–120ms`, red `\\u003e120ms`) and a favorite toggle.\\n- **Active Selection:** Bordered by a 1.5dp stroke of `Primary` with a soft 6% `Primary` surface tint.\\n\\n### Input Fields & Search Bars\\n- **Search Bar:** 48dp full pill, background `Surface Container High`, icon leading, clear action trailing. No border in resting state; 2dp `Primary` outline on focus.\\n- **Standard Text Fields:** 56dp height, rounded 16dp top and bottom corners, floating label architecture conforming to M3 specs. Background `Surface Container Low`.\\n\\n### Checkboxes, Radios, and Toggles\\n- **Switches (Kill Switch, Auto-Connect):** 32dp tall, 52dp wide pill track. Unchecked: track `Surface Container High`, thumb `Outline`. Checked: track `Primary`, thumb `On Primary` (thumb expands slightly on press).\\n- **Checkboxes:** 20×20dp box with 6dp corner radius. Checked fill `Primary` with `On Primary` check mark.\\n\\n### Telemetry / Traffic Cards\\n- **Geometry:** 24dp rounded rectangles using `Surface Container Low`.\\n- **Display:** Split-pane layout displaying Download/Upload live throughput with stylized sparklines drawn with a 2dp stroke in `Primary` and secondary muted teal. All numerical metrics use tabular figures (`title-lg`).\",\"colorVariant\":\"FIDELITY\",\"overridePrimaryColor\":\"#66d5ff\",\"overrideSecondaryColor\":\"#004d63\",\"overrideTertiaryColor\":\"#baeaff\",\"overrideNeutralColor\":\"#0f172a\",\"spacingScale\":2,\"typography\":{\"headline-md\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"28px\",\"fontWeight\":\"600\",\"lineHeight\":\"36px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0px\"},\"title-sm\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"14px\",\"fontWeight\":\"600\",\"lineHeight\":\"20px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0.1px\"},\"label-lg\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"14px\",\"fontWeight\":\"600\",\"lineHeight\":\"20px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0.1px\"},\"display-lg\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"57px\",\"fontWeight\":\"700\",\"lineHeight\":\"64px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.25px\"},\"body-lg\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"16px\",\"fontWeight\":\"400\",\"lineHeight\":\"24px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0.5px\"},\"body-md\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"14px\",\"fontWeight\":\"400\",\"lineHeight\":\"20px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0.25px\"},\"title-md\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"16px\",\"fontWeight\":\"600\",\"lineHeight\":\"24px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0.15px\"},\"headline-lg\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"32px\",\"fontWeight\":\"600\",\"lineHeight\":\"40px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0px\"},\"body-sm\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"12px\",\"fontWeight\":\"400\",\"lineHeight\":\"16px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0.4px\"},\"label-sm\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"11px\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\",\"lineHeight\":\"16px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0.5px\"},\"title-lg\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"22px\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\",\"lineHeight\":\"28px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0px\"},\"label-md\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"12px\",\"fontWeight\":\"600\",\"lineHeight\":\"16px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0.5px\"},\"headline-sm\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"24px\",\"fontWeight\":\"600\",\"lineHeight\":\"32px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0px\"},\"display-lg-mobile\":{\"fontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"fontSize\":\"44px\",\"fontWeight\":\"700\",\"lineHeight\":\"52px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.2px\"}},\"spacing\":{\"margin-tablet\":\"2rem\",\"space-xl\":\"2rem\",\"space-md\":\"1rem\",\"gutter-tablet\":\"1.5rem\",\"space-sm\":\"0.5rem\",\"space-xs\":\"0.25rem\",\"gutter\":\"1rem\",\"margin\":\"1rem\",\"space-lg\":\"1.5rem\"},\"headlineFontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"bodyFontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"labelFontFamily\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\"},\"manifestJson\":\"{\\\"designMd\\\":\\\"---\\\\nname: Aura Kinetic Security\\\\ncolors:\\\\n  surface: '#0b1326'\\\\n  surface-dim: '#0b1326'\\\\n  surface-bright: '#31394d'\\\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#060e20'\\\\n  surface-container-low: '#131b2e'\\\\n  surface-container: '#171f33'\\\\n  surface-container-high: '#222a3d'\\\\n  surface-container-highest: '#2d3449'\\\\n  on-surface: '#dae2fd'\\\\n  on-surface-variant: '#bdc8ce'\\\\n  inverse-surface: '#dae2fd'\\\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#283044'\\\\n  outline: '#879298'\\\\n  outline-variant: '#3e484e'\\\\n  surface-tint: '#64d3fd'\\\\n  primary: '#bfebff'\\\\n  on-primary: '#003545'\\\\n  primary-container: '#66d5ff'\\\\n  on-primary-container: '#005b74'\\\\n  inverse-primary: '#006782'\\\\n  secondary: '#95cfe9'\\\\n  on-secondary: '#003545'\\\\n  secondary-container: '#004d63'\\\\n  on-secondary-container: '#84bdd7'\\\\n  tertiary: '#bdebff'\\\\n  on-tertiary: '#003544'\\\\n  tertiary-container: '#a0cfe3'\\\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#29596b'\\\\n  error: '#ffb4ab'\\\\n  on-error: '#690005'\\\\n  error-container: '#93000a'\\\\n  on-error-container: '#ffdad6'\\\\n  primary-fixed: '#bbe9ff'\\\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#64d3fd'\\\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#001f29'\\\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#004d63'\\\\n  secondary-fixed: '#bce9ff'\\\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#95cfe9'\\\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#001f29'\\\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#004d63'\\\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#baeaff'\\\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#9ecee2'\\\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#001f29'\\\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#194c5e'\\\\n  background: '#0b1326'\\\\n  on-background: '#dae2fd'\\\\n  surface-variant: '#2d3449'\\\\ntypography:\\\\n  display-lg:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 57px\\\\n    fontWeight: '700'\\\\n    lineHeight: 64px\\\\n    letterSpacing: -0.25px\\\\n  display-lg-mobile:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 44px\\\\n    fontWeight: '700'\\\\n    lineHeight: 52px\\\\n    letterSpacing: -0.2px\\\\n  headline-lg:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 32px\\\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\\\n    lineHeight: 40px\\\\n    letterSpacing: 0px\\\\n  headline-md:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 28px\\\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\\\n    lineHeight: 36px\\\\n    letterSpacing: 0px\\\\n  headline-sm:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 24px\\\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\\\n    lineHeight: 32px\\\\n    letterSpacing: 0px\\\\n  title-lg:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 22px\\\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\\\n    lineHeight: 28px\\\\n    letterSpacing: 0px\\\\n  title-md:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 16px\\\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\\\n    lineHeight: 24px\\\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15px\\\\n  title-sm:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 14px\\\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\\\n    lineHeight: 20px\\\\n    letterSpacing: 0.1px\\\\n  body-lg:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 16px\\\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\\\n    lineHeight: 24px\\\\n    letterSpacing: 0.5px\\\\n  body-md:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 14px\\\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\\\n    lineHeight: 20px\\\\n    letterSpacing: 0.25px\\\\n  body-sm:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 12px\\\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\\\n    lineHeight: 16px\\\\n    letterSpacing: 0.4px\\\\n  label-lg:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 14px\\\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\\\n    lineHeight: 20px\\\\n    letterSpacing: 0.1px\\\\n  label-md:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 12px\\\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\\\n    lineHeight: 16px\\\\n    letterSpacing: 0.5px\\\\n  label-sm:\\\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\\\n    fontSize: 11px\\\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\\\n    lineHeight: 16px\\\\n    letterSpacing: 0.5px\\\\nrounded:\\\\n  sm: 0.5rem\\\\n  DEFAULT: 1rem\\\\n  md: 1.5rem\\\\n  lg: 2rem\\\\n  xl: 3rem\\\\n  full: 9999px\\\\nspacing:\\\\n  gutter: 1rem\\\\n  margin: 1rem\\\\n  gutter-tablet: 1.5rem\\\\n  margin-tablet: 2rem\\\\n  space-xs: 0.25rem\\\\n  space-sm: 0.5rem\\\\n  space-md: 1rem\\\\n  space-lg: 1.5rem\\\\n  space-xl: 2rem\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## Brand & Style\\\\n\\\\nThis design system translates next-generation mobile cybersecurity into an experience defined by calm confidence, intelligent protection, and fluid connectivity. Rather than relying on defensive alarmism or sterile utility, the interface projects an ambient shield: high-trust, unobtrusive during steady-state protection, yet dynamically expressive during transitions, threats, and state changes.\\\\n\\\\nRooted in an evolution of Material Design 3 Expressive, the aesthetic pairs disciplined, ergonomic Android architecture with luminous ambient indicators. Visual states leverage soft glowing halos, adaptive tonal surface containers, and organic pill-shaped touch surfaces. The interaction tone balances surgical privacy engineering with approachable simplicity for mobile-first workflows.\\\\n\\\\n## Colors\\\\n\\\\nThe system operates with `dark` as its primary default state, mirroring privacy-focused Android flagship applications and reducing OLED display power consumption during persistent background usage. \\\\n\\\\n### Dark Theme (Default)\\\\n- **Primary:** `#66D5FF` — Luminous cyber cyan/teal used for active protection indicators, primary FABs, and connected state signals.\\\\n- **On Primary:** `#003545` — Deep slate-teal providing high-contrast readability against glowing cyan controls.\\\\n- **Primary Container:** `#004D63` — Mid-tone cyan container applied to active server rows and selected segmented chips.\\\\n- **On Primary Container:** `#BAEAFF` — High-luminance accent tint for labels inside primary containers.\\\\n- **Surface:** `#0F172A` — Deep slate midnight canvas baseline.\\\\n- **Surface Container Low:** `#1E293B` — Resting cards, server list items, and metric groupings.\\\\n- **Surface Container High:** `#334155` — Elevated dialogs, active bottom sheets, and pressed states.\\\\n- **Outline:** `#8A9296` — Subtle boundary delineator calibrated for dark contrast compliance.\\\\n- **Error:** `#FFB4AB` — High-alert crimson tint for connection drops, kill switch triggers, and DNS leaks.\\\\n\\\\n### Light Theme\\\\n- **Primary:** `#006783` — Deep cyan for commanding actions, active toggles, and brand anchors.\\\\n- **On Primary:** `#FFFFFF` — Crisp optical white.\\\\n- **Primary Container:** `#BAEAFF` — Ice cyan background for activated utility blocks.\\\\n- **On Primary Container:** `#001F28` — Deepest midnight-teal text.\\\\n- **Surface:** `#F8FAFC` — Pure crisp backdrop.\\\\n- **Surface Container Low:** `#F1F5F9` — Primary grouping cards.\\\\n- **Surface Container High:** `#E2E8F0` — Modals, toolbars, and search bars.\\\\n- **Outline:** `#70787D` — Structural border definition.\\\\n- **Error:** `#BA1A1A` — High-visibility alert red.\\\\n\\\\nState layers apply an opacity overlay of the corresponding `on-*` color: Hover (8%), Focus (12%), Pressed (16%), and Dragged (20%).\\\\n\\\\n## Typography\\\\n\\\\nThe type system relies on `Plus Jakarta Sans` across all display, body, and label roles, using Android's system font as an immediate fallback. Its clean geometric curves and open counter forms ensure legibility at micro scales during status reporting (e.g., kilobits-per-second counters, IP addresses, latency graphs) while delivering a refined, modern tech presence on large display screens.\\\\n\\\\nNumbers in data counters, telemetry readouts, and throughput monitors must always enforce tabular figures (`font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums`) to prevent layout shifts during live ping and bandwidth fluctuations.\\\\n\\\\n## Layout & Spacing\\\\n\\\\nLayout geometry follows an 8dp structural grid, underpinned by a 4dp micro-grid for compact internal component spacing, badges, and icon pairings. All clickable targets strictly enforce a minimum touch target size of 48×48dp regardless of visual container boundary.\\\\n\\\\n- **Compact (Mobile: \\\\u003c 600dp):** Fluid single-column layout with 16dp (`margin`) screen edges and 16dp (`gutter`) card separation. Navigation utilizes an ergonomic bottom bar or expandable bottom sheet.\\\\n- **Medium (Tablet / Foldable unfolded: 600dp–839dp):** Dual-pane structure with 24dp screen padding and 32dp gutter. The primary pane houses connection controls and live status visualizations; the secondary pane houses server node directories and split-tunneling settings.\\\\n- **Expanded (Landscape / Large Screens: 840dp+):** Rail-based navigation with max-width content bounding containers set to 1040dp to prevent unwieldy scan lines on wide displays.\\\\n\\\\n## Elevation & Depth\\\\n\\\\nVisual hierarchy does not use sharp drop-shadows. Instead, elevation is achieved through a combination of M3 tonal layering, luminous halos, and low-contrast ghost outlines:\\\\n\\\\n1. **Surface Hierarchy (Tonal Stepping):** Depth is communicated through luminance progression. Base canvas rests on `Surface` (`#0F172A`). Resting cards sit on `Surface Container Low` (`#1E293B`). Lifted sheets, modals, and tooltips occupy `Surface Container High` (`#334155`).\\\\n2. **Halo Radiation (Active States):** The central connection node and active status chips project a dual-layer soft ambient glow rather than a standard shadow:\\\\n   - Primary Halo: `0 0 32px 0 rgba(102, 213, 255, 0.25)`\\\\n   - Intense Core Glow: `0 0 12px 2px rgba(102, 213, 255, 0.40)`\\\\n3. **Ghost Outlines:** Elevated surfaces are framed by a 1px border of `Outline` at 18% opacity, ensuring sharp separation between tonal tiers without heavy visual weight.\\\\n4. **Modal Elevation:** Full-screen dialogs and modal bottom sheets utilize a scrim overlay with a dynamic backdrop blur (`backdrop-filter: blur(16px)` with 60% opacity surface tint).\\\\n\\\\n## Shapes\\\\n\\\\nThe design system embraces an expressive corner philosophy, utilizing full pills for interaction touchpoints and soft rounded squircular forms for data containers:\\\\n\\\\n- **Full Pill (`9999px`):** Reserved for primary calls to action, the main connect toggle button, search input containers, chips, and navigation indicator pills.\\\\n- **Containers & Cards (`2rem` / 32px):** Applied to major dashboard panels, protocol configuration cards, and speed test containers.\\\\n- **Internal Nested Elements (`1rem` / 16px):** Used for nested sub-cards, server items within a grouped section, and secondary inputs.\\\\n- **Small Controls (`0.5rem` / 8px):** Checkboxes, status badges, and technical readouts.\\\\n\\\\n## Components\\\\n\\\\n### Hero Connect Button (Central Action)\\\\n- **Geometry:** Large 96dp circle (idle) or pill form, centered within a multi-ringed 160dp canvas.\\\\n- **Resting (Disconnected):** Outlined border (2dp) in `Outline` over `Surface Container Low`, containing a neutral power icon.\\\\n- **Active (Connected):** Filled container in `Primary` with `On Primary` icon. Enclosed by two pulsating concentric halo rings animating subtly between 12dp and 24dp scale with 20% opacity.\\\\n- **Connecting:** Continuous smooth angular sweep gradient rotating along the perimeter with a 4dp stroke.\\\\n\\\\n### Buttons\\\\n- **Primary:** Full pill (48dp height), background `Primary`, text `On Primary` (`label-lg`). Minimum width 120dp.\\\\n- **Tonal (Secondary):** Full pill (40dp height), background `Primary Container`, text `On Primary Container`.\\\\n- **Outlined:** 40dp pill, 1px border in `Outline` at 30% opacity, transparent background, text `Primary`.\\\\n- **Touch Target:** Internal padding at least 12dp horizontal, centered within 48dp absolute bounding box.\\\\n\\\\n### Chips (Protocol & Server Filters)\\\\n- **Height:** 32dp pill.\\\\n- **Unselected:** `Surface Container Low` with 1px border in `Outline` at 20% opacity. Text in `body-sm`.\\\\n- **Selected:** `Primary Container` with `On Primary Container` text, accompanied by a 16dp checkmark or active icon leading the label.\\\\n\\\\n### Server List Items\\\\n- **Structure:** 64dp vertical height card or continuous list item on `Surface Container Low`.\\\\n- **Content:** Left-aligned 28dp circular country flag avatar, followed by Server Name (`title-sm`) and City/IP (`body-sm`). Trailing block houses latency ping (color-coded badge: green `\\\\u003c50ms`, yellow `50–120ms`, red `\\\\u003e120ms`) and a favorite toggle.\\\\n- **Active Selection:** Bordered by a 1.5dp stroke of `Primary` with a soft 6% `Primary` surface tint.\\\\n\\\\n### Input Fields & Search Bars\\\\n- **Search Bar:** 48dp full pill, background `Surface Container High`, icon leading, clear action trailing. No border in resting state; 2dp `Primary` outline on focus.\\\\n- **Standard Text Fields:** 56dp height, rounded 16dp top and bottom corners, floating label architecture conforming to M3 specs. Background `Surface Container Low`.\\\\n\\\\n### Checkboxes, Radios, and Toggles\\\\n- **Switches (Kill Switch, Auto-Connect):** 32dp tall, 52dp wide pill track. Unchecked: track `Surface Container High`, thumb `Outline`. Checked: track `Primary`, thumb `On Primary` (thumb expands slightly on press).\\\\n- **Checkboxes:** 20×20dp box with 6dp corner radius. Checked fill `Primary` with `On Primary` check mark.\\\\n\\\\n### Telemetry / Traffic Cards\\\\n- **Geometry:** 24dp rounded rectangles using `Surface Container Low`.\\\\n- **Display:** Split-pane layout displaying Download/Upload live throughput with stylized sparklines drawn with a 2dp stroke in `Primary` and secondary muted teal. All numerical metrics use tabular figures (`title-lg`).\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"harness\\\",\\\"version\\\":1,\\\"isGeneratingComponents\\\":false,\\\"tokens\\\":{\\\"spacing\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"margin-tablet\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"margin-tablet\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"2rem\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"gutter-tablet\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"1.5rem\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"gutter-tablet\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"gutter\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"gutter\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"1rem\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"space-lg\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"space-lg\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"1.5rem\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"0.25rem\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"space-xs\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"space-xs\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"1rem\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"margin\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"margin\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"space-sm\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"space-sm\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"0.5rem\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"space-xl\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"space-xl\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"2rem\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"1rem\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"space-md\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"space-md\\\"}],\\\"radius\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"full\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"9999px\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"full\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"lg\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"2rem\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"lg\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"sm\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"0.5rem\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"sm\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"DEFAULT\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"9999px\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"DEFAULT\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"3rem\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"xl\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"xl\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"md\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"md\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"1.5rem\\\"}],\\\"colors\\\":[{\\\"role\\\":\\\"surface-container-low\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#131b2e\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surface Container Low\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"surface-container-low\\\"},{\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#001f29\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Secondary Fixed\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#bce9ff\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"secondary-fixed\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"secondary-fixed\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"#060e20\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"surface-container-lowest\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surface Container Lowest\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"surface-container-lowest\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Secondary Container\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"secondary-container\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"secondary-container\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#004d63\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#84bdd7\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"inverse-surface\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"inverse-surface\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#dae2fd\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Inverse Surface\\\"},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"surface-tint\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#64d3fd\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surface Tint\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"surface-tint\\\"},{\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#690005\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#ffb4ab\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"error\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"error\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Error\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"#0b1326\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"surface-dim\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"surface-dim\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surface Dim\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"primary-fixed\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"primary-fixed\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#001f29\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#bbe9ff\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Primary Fixed\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"tertiary\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#bdebff\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"tertiary\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#003544\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Tertiary\\\"},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"surface-variant\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"surface-variant\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#2d3449\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surface Variant\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#bdc8ce\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Tertiary Fixed\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"tertiary-fixed\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#001f29\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"tertiary-fixed\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#baeaff\\\"},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"inverse-on-surface\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Inverse On Surface\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#283044\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"inverse-on-surface\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"surface-container\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"surface-container\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#171f33\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surface Container\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"#95cfe9\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"secondary-fixed-dim\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"secondary-fixed-dim\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Secondary Fixed Dim\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"#222a3d\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"surface-container-high\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"surface-container-high\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surface Container High\\\"},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"outline\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Outline\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#879298\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"outline\\\"},{\\\"value\\\":\\\"#9ecee2\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"tertiary-fixed-dim\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Tertiary Fixed Dim\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"tertiary-fixed-dim\\\"},{\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#005b74\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"primary-container\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#66d5ff\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"primary-container\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Primary Container\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"surface-container-highest\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"surface-container-highest\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surface Container Highest\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#2d3449\\\"},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"primary-fixed-dim\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Primary Fixed Dim\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"primary-fixed-dim\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#64d3fd\\\"},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"neutral\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#0f172a\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Neutral\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"neutral\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"inverse-primary\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"inverse-primary\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#006782\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Inverse Primary\\\"},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"secondary\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Secondary\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#95cfe9\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#003545\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"secondary\\\"},{\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#dae2fd\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"surface\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#0b1326\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"surface\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surface\\\"},{\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#dae2fd\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"background\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Background\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#0b1326\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"background\\\"},{\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#29596b\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"tertiary-container\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#a0cfe3\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Tertiary Container\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"tertiary-container\\\"},{\\\"role\\\":\\\"surface-bright\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#31394d\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"surface-bright\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Surface Bright\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"outline-variant\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"outline-variant\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Outline Variant\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#3e484e\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"primary\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Primary\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#bfebff\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#003545\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"primary\\\"},{\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#ffdad6\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Error Container\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"#93000a\\\",\\\"role\\\":\\\"error-container\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"error-container\\\"}],\\\"surface\\\":{\\\"dark\\\":{\\\"outline\\\":\\\"#3e484e\\\",\\\"background\\\":\\\"#0b1326\\\",\\\"surface\\\":\\\"#171f33\\\",\\\"onSurface\\\":\\\"#bdc8ce\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#dae2fd\\\"},\\\"light\\\":{\\\"outline\\\":\\\"#3e484e\\\",\\\"onSurface\\\":\\\"#bdc8ce\\\",\\\"background\\\":\\\"#0b1326\\\",\\\"foreground\\\":\\\"#dae2fd\\\",\\\"surface\\\":\\\"#171f33\\\"}},\\\"type\\\":[{\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"40px\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Headline LG\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"32px\\\",\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"0px\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"600\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"headline-lg\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"title-md\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Title MD\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"16px\\\",\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"0.15px\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"600\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"24px\\\"},{\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"16px\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Label SM\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"11px\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"label-sm\\\",\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"0.5px\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"500\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Label LG\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"14px\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"600\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"20px\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"label-lg\\\",\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"0.1px\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Title SM\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"14px\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"title-sm\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"600\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"20px\\\",\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"0.1px\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Body LG\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"16px\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"body-lg\\\",\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"0.5px\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"24px\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"400\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Body MD\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"14px\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"400\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"body-md\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"20px\\\",\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"0.25px\\\"},{\\\"weight\\\":\\\"600\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"headline-md\\\",\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"0px\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Headline MD\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"28px\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"36px\\\"},{\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"0.4px\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"400\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"16px\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"body-sm\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Body SM\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"12px\\\"},{\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"28px\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"500\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Title LG\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"22px\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"0px\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"title-lg\\\"},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Label MD\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"12px\\\",\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"0.5px\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"16px\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"600\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"label-md\\\"},{\\\"weight\\\":\\\"600\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"headline-sm\\\",\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"0px\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"32px\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Headline SM\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"24px\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":\\\"display-lg\\\",\\\"letterSpacing\\\":\\\"-0.25px\\\",\\\"weight\\\":\\\"700\\\",\\\"lineHeight\\\":\\\"64px\\\",\\\"family\\\":\\\"Plus Jakarta Sans\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Display LG\\\",\\\"size\\\":\\\"57px\\\"}]},\\\"identity\\\":{\\\"name\\\":\\\"Aura Kinetic Security\\\"}}\"},\"version\":\"1\"}]}","type":"text"}],"structuredContent":{"designSystems":[{"designSystem":{"displayName":"Obsidian Cyber-Shield","manifestJson":"{\"source\":\"harness\",\"version\":1,\"identity\":{\"name\":\"Obsidian Cyber-Shield\"},\"isGeneratingComponents\":false,\"designMd\":\"---\\nname: Obsidian Cyber-Shield\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#0f131c'\\n  surface-dim: '#0f131c'\\n  surface-bright: '#353942'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#0a0e16'\\n  surface-container-low: '#181c24'\\n  surface-container: '#1c2028'\\n  surface-container-high: '#262a33'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#31353e'\\n  on-surface: '#dfe2ee'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#bacbbd'\\n  inverse-surface: '#dfe2ee'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#2c3039'\\n  outline: '#849588'\\n  outline-variant: '#3b4a3f'\\n  surface-tint: '#00e38d'\\n  primary: '#6dffb1'\\n  on-primary: '#003920'\\n  primary-container: '#00e58f'\\n  on-primary-container: '#006139'\\n  inverse-primary: '#006d41'\\n  secondary: '#f5fff2'\\n  on-secondary: '#003919'\\n  secondary-container: '#36ff8b'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#007238'\\n  tertiary: '#c9e9ff'\\n  on-tertiary: '#00354a'\\n  tertiary-container: '#82d2ff'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#005a7b'\\n  error: '#ffb4ab'\\n  on-error: '#690005'\\n  error-container: '#93000a'\\n  on-error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  primary-fixed: '#54ffaa'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#00e38d'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#002110'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#005230'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#61ff97'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#00e476'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#00210c'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#005227'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#c4e7ff'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#7bd0ff'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#001e2c'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#004c69'\\n  background: '#0f131c'\\n  on-background: '#dfe2ee'\\n  surface-variant: '#31353e'\\ntypography:\\n  display-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 36px\\n    fontWeight: '800'\\n    lineHeight: 44px\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  display-md:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 30px\\n    fontWeight: '800'\\n    lineHeight: 38px\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 28px\\n    fontWeight: '700'\\n    lineHeight: 36px\\n    letterSpacing: -0.01em\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 24px\\n    fontWeight: '700'\\n    lineHeight: 32px\\n    letterSpacing: -0.01em\\n  title-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 22px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 28px\\n  title-md:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 18px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 24px\\n  title-sm:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 22px\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: 24px\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: 20px\\n  label-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 20px\\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\\n  label-md:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 13px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: 18px\\n  label-sm:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: 16px\\n    letterSpacing: 0.02em\\n  metric-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 34px\\n    fontWeight: '700'\\n    lineHeight: 40px\\n    letterSpacing: -0.03em\\n  metric-md:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 24px\\n    fontWeight: '700'\\n    lineHeight: 30px\\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.25rem\\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\\n  md: 0.75rem\\n  lg: 1rem\\n  xl: 1.5rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  gutter: 1rem\\n  gutter-tablet: 1.5rem\\n  gutter-desktop: 2rem\\n  margin: 1rem\\n  margin-tablet: 2rem\\n  margin-desktop: 3rem\\n  space-xs: 0.25rem\\n  space-sm: 0.5rem\\n  space-md: 1rem\\n  space-lg: 1.5rem\\n  space-xl: 2rem\\n---\\n\\n## Brand & Style\\nThis design system adapts Material Design 3 Expressive for high-security consumer networking and privacy software. It blends deep obsidian surfaces with electric cybernetic illumination, projecting impregnable operational defense, near-zero latency, and military-grade telemetry. \\n\\nThe aesthetic synthesizes:\\n- **Glassmorphic Obsidian**: Multi-tiered semi-translucent dark surfaces featuring back-layer diffusion, fine boundary highlights, and disciplined contrast.\\n- **Bioluminescent Accents**: Electric emerald and neon mint glows that function as authoritative indicators of cryptographic connection states.\\n- **Cyber-Precision Telemetry**: Monospace tabular metrics paired with soft, rounded typography to balance technical credibility with consumer approachability.\\n\\nThe emotional signature is calming invulnerability: users transition from raw, exposed network environments into an encrypted, monitored enclosure.\\n\\n## Colors\\nThe palette uses functional radiance atop pure dark substrates. Pure black is avoided in favor of Obsidian Black (`#0B0F17`) to prevent OLED smear and preserve subtle ambient shadows.\\n\\n### Surface System\\n- **Main Background**: `#0B0F17` (Canvas foundation)\\n- **Elevated Background**: `#101722` (Modals, bottom sheets, secondary overlays)\\n- **Primary Card Surface**: `#141B26` (Standard containment cards, metric groups)\\n- **Secondary Card Surface**: `#1E2638` (Interactive items inside containers, active selections)\\n- **Glass Border Stroke**: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)` (Uniform 1px edge boundary)\\n\\n### Chromatic Roles\\n- **Primary Accent (`#00E58F`)**: Electric emerald for secure states, primary interactive triggers, and core encryption halos.\\n- **Highlight Accent (`#00FF85`)**: Neon mint for high-energy telemetry pings, live packet animations, and key callout states.\\n- **Telemetry Cyan (`#38BDF8`)**: Downstream/upstream throughput readouts, IP details, and protocol badges.\\n- **Warning Amber (`#FFBC5E`)**: Unsecured Wi-Fi alerts, latency bottlenecks, and server load warnings (\\u003e80%).\\n- **Critical / Disconnected (`#FF6178`)**: Kill switch activations, dropped tunnels, and unencrypted risk warnings.\\n\\n### Typography & Contrast\\n- **High-Emphasis Text**: `#FFFFFF` (Primary titles, essential status headers)\\n- **Medium-Emphasis Text**: `#B3BAC5` (Explanatory body text, active parameter values)\\n- **Low-Emphasis / Disabled**: `#737C8C` (Protocol versions, inactive headers, timestamp metadata)\\n\\n## Typography\\nPlus Jakarta Sans provides high legibility on dark glass surfaces through open apertures, large x-height, and clean geometric forms.\\n\\n- **Numerics & Telemetry**: `metric-lg` and `metric-md` must be rendered with OpenType tabular figures (`font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;`) to prevent layout shifts during live ping, throughput, and IP metric updates.\\n- **Hierarchy Scale**:\\n  - `display-lg` / `display-md`: Large landing titles and dashboard encryption states (\\\"PROTECTED\\\", \\\"DISCONNECTED\\\").\\n  - `headline-lg` / `headline-md`: Modal headers and configuration screens.\\n  - `title-lg` / `title-md`: Connection status headers and selected server region names.\\n  - `title-sm`: Card-level titles and parameter groupings.\\n  - `body-lg` / `body-md`: Standard functional descriptions and protocol configuration body copy.\\n  - `label-sm` / `label-md`: System metadata, timestamp readings, security hash previews, and secondary labels.\\n\\n## Layout & Spacing\\nThe layout system uses an 8dp baseline grid (with 4dp sub-increments for dense data points), structured around full-width responsive containment zones.\\n\\n- **Grid Architecture**:\\n  - **Mobile (\\u003c600dp)**: 4 fluid columns, 16dp margins, 16dp gutters. Single-column stacked cards.\\n  - **Tablet (600–1024dp)**: 8 fluid columns, 32dp margins, 24dp gutters. Two-column layout split between earth wireframe telemetry and server configuration.\\n  - **Desktop (\\u003e1024dp)**: 12 fluid columns, 48dp margins, 32dp gutters with a max canvas width of 1440dp.\\n- **Rhythm & Safe Areas**:\\n  - Top canvas maintains 16dp spacing below system status bars.\\n  - Bottom edge incorporates an 88dp clearance offset to float the bottom navigation dock without obscuring interactive controls.\\n- **Density**: Cards use 16dp to 24dp internal padding (`space-md` to `space-lg`), keeping compact layouts readable.\\n\\n## Elevation & Depth\\nDepth is built with tinted ambient glows and translucent glass layering rather than traditional drop shadows.\\n\\n- **Base Canvas**: Pure `#0B0F17`, no elevation.\\n- **Surface Elevation 1 (Cards)**:\\n  - Fill: `#141B26` at 85% opacity with `backdrop-filter: blur(20px)`.\\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`.\\n  - Ambient Glow: Soft bottom glow (`0px 12px 32px -8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)`).\\n- **Surface Elevation 2 (Active/Connected Cards)**:\\n  - Fill: `#1E2638` at 90% opacity with `backdrop-filter: blur(24px)`.\\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.3)`.\\n  - Ambient Glow: `0px 8px 30px rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.12)`, producing an emerald aura around the active server.\\n- **Surface Elevation 3 (Floating Nav Dock & Modals)**:\\n  - Fill: `#101722` at 80% opacity with `backdrop-filter: blur(28px)`.\\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12)`.\\n  - Ambient Shadow: `0px 20px 40px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8)`.\\n\\n## Shapes\\nFollowing Material Design 3 Expressive principles, container shapes balance geometric structure with friendly, ergonomic corners.\\n\\n- **Primary & Secondary Cards**: 24dp corner radii (`rounded-xl` variant override).\\n- **Floating Bottom Navigation Dock**: 28dp capsule radius for a smooth floating pill shape.\\n- **Interactive Action Triggers (CTAs)**: Full capsule/pill radius (9999dp) or 24dp corner radius.\\n- **Input Fields & Quick Selectors**: 16dp corner radius (`rounded-lg`).\\n- **Telemetry Badges & Minor Chips**: 8dp to 12dp corner radius (`rounded-md`).\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Hero Connection Controller\\n- The primary connection module features an interactive multi-ring component enclosing a holographic 3D wireframe Earth.\\n- **Disconnected State**: Rings render in `#1E2638` with static 1px borders; central power glyph tinted `#737C8C`.\\n- **Connected State**: Rings render in `#00E58F` with an outer pulsing halo (`0 0 40px rgba(0, 255, 133, 0.35)`). A subtle rotational radar sweep runs at 0.5Hz.\\n- Touch target: minimum 120dp circular area with 48dp minimum internal strike-zone.\\n\\n### Buttons & Interactive CTAs\\n- **Primary Glowing CTA**: \\n  - Height: 56dp (touch safe).\\n  - Background: Gradient from `#00E58F` to `#00FF85`.\\n  - Text: `#0B0F17` in `label-lg` ExtraBold.\\n  - Box Shadow: `0 4px 20px rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.4)`.\\n  - Hover/Active: Translates to a scale of 0.98; brightness increases by 10%.\\n- **Secondary Ghost Button**:\\n  - Height: 48dp.\\n  - Background: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04)`.\\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12)`.\\n  - Text: `#FFFFFF` in `label-lg` SemiBold.\\n\\n### Floating Bottom Navigation Dock\\n- Height: 64dp, margin: 16dp horizontal, floating 24dp above device edge.\\n- Radius: 28dp, fill: `#101722` at 85% opacity with 24px blur.\\n- Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`.\\n- Active Icon: Highlighted with an emerald indicator pill (`rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.15)`) with an icon color of `#00E58F`.\\n- Minimum tap target for each tab: 48dp × 48dp.\\n\\n### Cards & Telemetry Containers\\n- **Server Selection Tile**: \\n  - Height: 72dp.\\n  - Background: `#141B26` with 24dp radius and 1px `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)` border.\\n  - Country flag indicator, server location in `title-sm`, ping latency badge in `#38BDF8`.\\n  - Active state triggers a 1px border of `#00E58F` with 8% emerald fill tint.\\n- **Live Metrics Card**:\\n  - Two-column card showing upstream and downstream speeds.\\n  - Download: Cyan (`#38BDF8`) glyph with `metric-md` numeric counter.\\n  - Upload: Neon Mint (`#00FF85`) glyph with `metric-md` numeric counter.\\n\\n### Switches, Toggles & Checkboxes\\n- **MD3 Expressive Switch**:\\n  - Track: 52dp width × 32dp height, fully rounded pill. Unchecked track `#1E2638`; checked track `#00E58F`.\\n  - Thumb: 24dp circle. Unchecked `#737C8C`; checked `#0B0F17`.\\n  - Integrated with haptic feedback tick upon state change.\\n\\n### Input Fields\\n- Height: 56dp.\\n- Fill: `#141B26`, border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)`. Radius: 16dp.\\n- Focused State: Border changes to 1.5px solid `#00E58F` with `box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.2)`.\",\"tokens\":{\"radius\":[{\"value\":\"1rem\",\"name\":\"lg\",\"id\":\"lg\"},{\"id\":\"full\",\"value\":\"9999px\",\"name\":\"full\"},{\"value\":\"0.25rem\",\"name\":\"sm\",\"id\":\"sm\"},{\"id\":\"DEFAULT\",\"name\":\"DEFAULT\",\"value\":\"8px\"},{\"value\":\"1.5rem\",\"name\":\"xl\",\"id\":\"xl\"},{\"value\":\"0.75rem\",\"id\":\"md\",\"name\":\"md\"}],\"colors\":[{\"role\":\"neutral\",\"name\":\"Neutral\",\"id\":\"neutral\",\"value\":\"#0b0f17\"},{\"name\":\"Tertiary Container\",\"value\":\"#82d2ff\",\"id\":\"tertiary-container\",\"role\":\"tertiary-container\",\"foreground\":\"#005a7b\"},{\"id\":\"primary-fixed\",\"role\":\"primary-fixed\",\"foreground\":\"#002110\",\"value\":\"#54ffaa\",\"name\":\"Primary Fixed\"},{\"value\":\"#0f131c\",\"id\":\"surface-dim\",\"role\":\"surface-dim\",\"name\":\"Surface Dim\"},{\"role\":\"surface-container-low\",\"name\":\"Surface Container Low\",\"id\":\"surface-container-low\",\"value\":\"#181c24\"},{\"role\":\"outline\",\"value\":\"#849588\",\"name\":\"Outline\",\"id\":\"outline\"},{\"value\":\"#006d41\",\"id\":\"inverse-primary\",\"role\":\"inverse-primary\",\"name\":\"Inverse Primary\"},{\"id\":\"tertiary-fixed-dim\",\"role\":\"tertiary-fixed-dim\",\"value\":\"#7bd0ff\",\"name\":\"Tertiary Fixed Dim\"},{\"role\":\"surface-bright\",\"name\":\"Surface Bright\",\"value\":\"#353942\",\"id\":\"surface-bright\"},{\"value\":\"#6dffb1\",\"foreground\":\"#003920\",\"role\":\"primary\",\"name\":\"Primary\",\"id\":\"primary\"},{\"foreground\":\"#ffdad6\",\"id\":\"error-container\",\"name\":\"Error Container\",\"value\":\"#93000a\",\"role\":\"error-container\"},{\"value\":\"#1c2028\",\"role\":\"surface-container\",\"name\":\"Surface Container\",\"id\":\"surface-container\"},{\"id\":\"surface\",\"name\":\"Surface\",\"value\":\"#0f131c\",\"foreground\":\"#dfe2ee\",\"role\":\"surface\"},{\"role\":\"outline-variant\",\"name\":\"Outline Variant\",\"value\":\"#3b4a3f\",\"id\":\"outline-variant\"},{\"role\":\"inverse-on-surface\",\"value\":\"#2c3039\",\"name\":\"Inverse On Surface\",\"id\":\"inverse-on-surface\"},{\"name\":\"Secondary Fixed\",\"value\":\"#61ff97\",\"id\":\"secondary-fixed\",\"role\":\"secondary-fixed\",\"foreground\":\"#00210c\"},{\"value\":\"#00e58f\",\"role\":\"primary-container\",\"id\":\"primary-container\",\"name\":\"Primary Container\",\"foreground\":\"#006139\"},{\"id\":\"secondary-fixed-dim\",\"role\":\"secondary-fixed-dim\",\"name\":\"Secondary Fixed Dim\",\"value\":\"#00e476\"},{\"role\":\"surface-container-high\",\"name\":\"Surface Container High\",\"id\":\"surface-container-high\",\"value\":\"#262a33\"},{\"value\":\"#00e38d\",\"role\":\"surface-tint\",\"name\":\"Surface Tint\",\"id\":\"surface-tint\"},{\"value\":\"#00e38d\",\"role\":\"primary-fixed-dim\",\"name\":\"Primary Fixed Dim\",\"id\":\"primary-fixed-dim\"},{\"role\":\"tertiary-fixed\",\"foreground\":\"#001e2c\",\"value\":\"#c4e7ff\",\"name\":\"Tertiary Fixed\",\"id\":\"tertiary-fixed\"},{\"id\":\"surface-variant\",\"role\":\"surface-variant\",\"value\":\"#31353e\",\"name\":\"Surface Variant\",\"foreground\":\"#bacbbd\"},{\"role\":\"surface-container-highest\",\"name\":\"Surface Container Highest\",\"value\":\"#31353e\",\"id\":\"surface-container-highest\"},{\"value\":\"#dfe2ee\",\"role\":\"inverse-surface\",\"name\":\"Inverse Surface\",\"id\":\"inverse-surface\"},{\"role\":\"surface-container-lowest\",\"name\":\"Surface Container Lowest\",\"value\":\"#0a0e16\",\"id\":\"surface-container-lowest\"},{\"id\":\"background\",\"foreground\":\"#dfe2ee\",\"role\":\"background\",\"value\":\"#0f131c\",\"name\":\"Background\"},{\"foreground\":\"#00354a\",\"value\":\"#c9e9ff\",\"role\":\"tertiary\",\"id\":\"tertiary\",\"name\":\"Tertiary\"},{\"foreground\":\"#690005\",\"role\":\"error\",\"value\":\"#ffb4ab\",\"name\":\"Error\",\"id\":\"error\"},{\"role\":\"secondary-container\",\"id\":\"secondary-container\",\"value\":\"#36ff8b\",\"name\":\"Secondary Container\",\"foreground\":\"#007238\"},{\"role\":\"secondary\",\"foreground\":\"#003919\",\"id\":\"secondary\",\"name\":\"Secondary\",\"value\":\"#f5fff2\"}],\"type\":[{\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.01em\",\"name\":\"Headline MD\",\"size\":\"24px\",\"lineHeight\":\"32px\",\"weight\":\"700\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"id\":\"headline-md\"},{\"name\":\"Title MD\",\"size\":\"18px\",\"id\":\"title-md\",\"lineHeight\":\"24px\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"weight\":\"600\"},{\"weight\":\"400\",\"id\":\"label-sm\",\"name\":\"Label SM\",\"size\":\"12px\",\"lineHeight\":\"16px\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0.02em\"},{\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.01em\",\"id\":\"headline-lg\",\"name\":\"Headline LG\",\"size\":\"28px\",\"lineHeight\":\"36px\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"weight\":\"700\"},{\"id\":\"label-lg\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0.01em\",\"lineHeight\":\"20px\",\"weight\":\"600\",\"name\":\"Label LG\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"size\":\"14px\"},{\"id\":\"metric-lg\",\"name\":\"Metric LG\",\"size\":\"34px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.03em\",\"lineHeight\":\"40px\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"weight\":\"700\"},{\"lineHeight\":\"22px\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"name\":\"Title SM\",\"size\":\"16px\",\"weight\":\"600\",\"id\":\"title-sm\"},{\"weight\":\"500\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"id\":\"body-lg\",\"lineHeight\":\"24px\",\"name\":\"Body LG\",\"size\":\"16px\"},{\"id\":\"body-md\",\"lineHeight\":\"20px\",\"weight\":\"500\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"name\":\"Body MD\",\"size\":\"14px\"},{\"id\":\"display-md\",\"weight\":\"800\",\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.02em\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"lineHeight\":\"38px\",\"name\":\"Display MD\",\"size\":\"30px\"},{\"weight\":\"600\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"id\":\"title-lg\",\"lineHeight\":\"28px\",\"name\":\"Title LG\",\"size\":\"22px\"},{\"id\":\"label-md\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"lineHeight\":\"18px\",\"weight\":\"400\",\"name\":\"Label MD\",\"size\":\"13px\"},{\"name\":\"Metric MD\",\"size\":\"24px\",\"id\":\"metric-md\",\"lineHeight\":\"30px\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"weight\":\"700\",\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.02em\"},{\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.02em\",\"name\":\"Display LG\",\"size\":\"36px\",\"id\":\"display-lg\",\"lineHeight\":\"44px\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"weight\":\"800\"}],\"surface\":{\"light\":{\"outline\":\"#3b4a3f\",\"foreground\":\"#dfe2ee\",\"surface\":\"#1c2028\",\"background\":\"#0f131c\",\"onSurface\":\"#bacbbd\"},\"dark\":{\"onSurface\":\"#bacbbd\",\"outline\":\"#3b4a3f\",\"foreground\":\"#dfe2ee\",\"surface\":\"#1c2028\",\"background\":\"#0f131c\"}},\"spacing\":[{\"name\":\"space-md\",\"value\":\"1rem\",\"id\":\"space-md\"},{\"value\":\"1rem\",\"id\":\"margin\",\"name\":\"margin\"},{\"id\":\"space-xl\",\"name\":\"space-xl\",\"value\":\"2rem\"},{\"id\":\"gutter\",\"name\":\"gutter\",\"value\":\"1rem\"},{\"id\":\"space-sm\",\"name\":\"space-sm\",\"value\":\"0.5rem\"},{\"value\":\"3rem\",\"name\":\"margin-desktop\",\"id\":\"margin-desktop\"},{\"id\":\"space-xs\",\"name\":\"space-xs\",\"value\":\"0.25rem\"},{\"value\":\"1.5rem\",\"name\":\"space-lg\",\"id\":\"space-lg\"},{\"value\":\"2rem\",\"name\":\"gutter-desktop\",\"id\":\"gutter-desktop\"},{\"name\":\"margin-tablet\",\"value\":\"2rem\",\"id\":\"margin-tablet\"},{\"value\":\"1.5rem\",\"id\":\"gutter-tablet\",\"name\":\"gutter-tablet\"}]}}","styleGuidelines":"## Brand & Style\nThis design system adapts Material Design 3 Expressive for high-security consumer networking and privacy software. It blends deep obsidian surfaces with electric cybernetic illumination, projecting impregnable operational defense, near-zero latency, and military-grade telemetry. \n\nThe aesthetic synthesizes:\n- **Glassmorphic Obsidian**: Multi-tiered semi-translucent dark surfaces featuring back-layer diffusion, fine boundary highlights, and disciplined contrast.\n- **Bioluminescent Accents**: Electric emerald and neon mint glows that function as authoritative indicators of cryptographic connection states.\n- **Cyber-Precision Telemetry**: Monospace tabular metrics paired with soft, rounded typography to balance technical credibility with consumer approachability.\n\nThe emotional signature is calming invulnerability: users transition from raw, exposed network environments into an encrypted, monitored enclosure.\n\n## Layout & Spacing\nThe layout system uses an 8dp baseline grid (with 4dp sub-increments for dense data points), structured around full-width responsive containment zones.\n\n- **Grid Architecture**:\n  - **Mobile (<600dp)**: 4 fluid columns, 16dp margins, 16dp gutters. Single-column stacked cards.\n  - **Tablet (600–1024dp)**: 8 fluid columns, 32dp margins, 24dp gutters. Two-column layout split between earth wireframe telemetry and server configuration.\n  - **Desktop (>1024dp)**: 12 fluid columns, 48dp margins, 32dp gutters with a max canvas width of 1440dp.\n- **Rhythm & Safe Areas**:\n  - Top canvas maintains 16dp spacing below system status bars.\n  - Bottom edge incorporates an 88dp clearance offset to float the bottom navigation dock without obscuring interactive controls.\n- **Density**: Cards use 16dp to 24dp internal padding (`space-md` to `space-lg`), keeping compact layouts readable.\n\n## Elevation & Depth\nDepth is built with tinted ambient glows and translucent glass layering rather than traditional drop shadows.\n\n- **Base Canvas**: Pure `#0B0F17`, no elevation.\n- **Surface Elevation 1 (Cards)**:\n  - Fill: `#141B26` at 85% opacity with `backdrop-filter: blur(20px)`.\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`.\n  - Ambient Glow: Soft bottom glow (`0px 12px 32px -8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)`).\n- **Surface Elevation 2 (Active/Connected Cards)**:\n  - Fill: `#1E2638` at 90% opacity with `backdrop-filter: blur(24px)`.\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.3)`.\n  - Ambient Glow: `0px 8px 30px rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.12)`, producing an emerald aura around the active server.\n- **Surface Elevation 3 (Floating Nav Dock & Modals)**:\n  - Fill: `#101722` at 80% opacity with `backdrop-filter: blur(28px)`.\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12)`.\n  - Ambient Shadow: `0px 20px 40px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8)`.\n\n## Components\n\n### Hero Connection Controller\n- The primary connection module features an interactive multi-ring component enclosing a holographic 3D wireframe Earth.\n- **Disconnected State**: Rings render in `#1E2638` with static 1px borders; central power glyph tinted `#737C8C`.\n- **Connected State**: Rings render in `#00E58F` with an outer pulsing halo (`0 0 40px rgba(0, 255, 133, 0.35)`). A subtle rotational radar sweep runs at 0.5Hz.\n- Touch target: minimum 120dp circular area with 48dp minimum internal strike-zone.\n\n### Buttons & Interactive CTAs\n- **Primary Glowing CTA**: \n  - Height: 56dp (touch safe).\n  - Background: Gradient from `#00E58F` to `#00FF85`.\n  - Text: `#0B0F17` in `label-lg` ExtraBold.\n  - Box Shadow: `0 4px 20px rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.4)`.\n  - Hover/Active: Translates to a scale of 0.98; brightness increases by 10%.\n- **Secondary Ghost Button**:\n  - Height: 48dp.\n  - Background: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04)`.\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12)`.\n  - Text: `#FFFFFF` in `label-lg` SemiBold.\n\n### Floating Bottom Navigation Dock\n- Height: 64dp, margin: 16dp horizontal, floating 24dp above device edge.\n- Radius: 28dp, fill: `#101722` at 85% opacity with 24px blur.\n- Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`.\n- Active Icon: Highlighted with an emerald indicator pill (`rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.15)`) with an icon color of `#00E58F`.\n- Minimum tap target for each tab: 48dp × 48dp.\n\n### Cards & Telemetry Containers\n- **Server Selection Tile**: \n  - Height: 72dp.\n  - Background: `#141B26` with 24dp radius and 1px `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)` border.\n  - Country flag indicator, server location in `title-sm`, ping latency badge in `#38BDF8`.\n  - Active state triggers a 1px border of `#00E58F` with 8% emerald fill tint.\n- **Live Metrics Card**:\n  - Two-column card showing upstream and downstream speeds.\n  - Download: Cyan (`#38BDF8`) glyph with `metric-md` numeric counter.\n  - Upload: Neon Mint (`#00FF85`) glyph with `metric-md` numeric counter.\n\n### Switches, Toggles & Checkboxes\n- **MD3 Expressive Switch**:\n  - Track: 52dp width × 32dp height, fully rounded pill. Unchecked track `#1E2638`; checked track `#00E58F`.\n  - Thumb: 24dp circle. Unchecked `#737C8C`; checked `#0B0F17`.\n  - Integrated with haptic feedback tick upon state change.\n\n### Input Fields\n- Height: 56dp.\n- Fill: `#141B26`, border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)`. Radius: 16dp.\n- Focused State: Border changes to 1.5px solid `#00E58F` with `box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.2)`.","theme":{"bodyFont":"PLUS_JAKARTA_SANS","bodyFontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","colorMode":"DARK","colorVariant":"FIDELITY","customColor":"#00e58f","designMd":"---\nname: Obsidian Cyber-Shield\ncolors:\n  surface: '#0f131c'\n  surface-dim: '#0f131c'\n  surface-bright: '#353942'\n  surface-container-lowest: '#0a0e16'\n  surface-container-low: '#181c24'\n  surface-container: '#1c2028'\n  surface-container-high: '#262a33'\n  surface-container-highest: '#31353e'\n  on-surface: '#dfe2ee'\n  on-surface-variant: '#bacbbd'\n  inverse-surface: '#dfe2ee'\n  inverse-on-surface: '#2c3039'\n  outline: '#849588'\n  outline-variant: '#3b4a3f'\n  surface-tint: '#00e38d'\n  primary: '#6dffb1'\n  on-primary: '#003920'\n  primary-container: '#00e58f'\n  on-primary-container: '#006139'\n  inverse-primary: '#006d41'\n  secondary: '#f5fff2'\n  on-secondary: '#003919'\n  secondary-container: '#36ff8b'\n  on-secondary-container: '#007238'\n  tertiary: '#c9e9ff'\n  on-tertiary: '#00354a'\n  tertiary-container: '#82d2ff'\n  on-tertiary-container: '#005a7b'\n  error: '#ffb4ab'\n  on-error: '#690005'\n  error-container: '#93000a'\n  on-error-container: '#ffdad6'\n  primary-fixed: '#54ffaa'\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#00e38d'\n  on-primary-fixed: '#002110'\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#005230'\n  secondary-fixed: '#61ff97'\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#00e476'\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#00210c'\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#005227'\n  tertiary-fixed: '#c4e7ff'\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#7bd0ff'\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#001e2c'\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#004c69'\n  background: '#0f131c'\n  on-background: '#dfe2ee'\n  surface-variant: '#31353e'\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 36px\n    fontWeight: '800'\n    lineHeight: 44px\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\n  display-md:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 30px\n    fontWeight: '800'\n    lineHeight: 38px\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\n  headline-lg:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 28px\n    fontWeight: '700'\n    lineHeight: 36px\n    letterSpacing: -0.01em\n  headline-md:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 24px\n    fontWeight: '700'\n    lineHeight: 32px\n    letterSpacing: -0.01em\n  title-lg:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 22px\n    fontWeight: '600'\n    lineHeight: 28px\n  title-md:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 18px\n    fontWeight: '600'\n    lineHeight: 24px\n  title-sm:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 16px\n    fontWeight: '600'\n    lineHeight: 22px\n  body-lg:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 16px\n    fontWeight: '500'\n    lineHeight: 24px\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 14px\n    fontWeight: '500'\n    lineHeight: 20px\n  label-lg:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 14px\n    fontWeight: '600'\n    lineHeight: 20px\n    letterSpacing: 0.01em\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 13px\n    fontWeight: '400'\n    lineHeight: 18px\n  label-sm:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 12px\n    fontWeight: '400'\n    lineHeight: 16px\n    letterSpacing: 0.02em\n  metric-lg:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 34px\n    fontWeight: '700'\n    lineHeight: 40px\n    letterSpacing: -0.03em\n  metric-md:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 24px\n    fontWeight: '700'\n    lineHeight: 30px\n    letterSpacing: -0.02em\nrounded:\n  sm: 0.25rem\n  DEFAULT: 0.5rem\n  md: 0.75rem\n  lg: 1rem\n  xl: 1.5rem\n  full: 9999px\nspacing:\n  gutter: 1rem\n  gutter-tablet: 1.5rem\n  gutter-desktop: 2rem\n  margin: 1rem\n  margin-tablet: 2rem\n  margin-desktop: 3rem\n  space-xs: 0.25rem\n  space-sm: 0.5rem\n  space-md: 1rem\n  space-lg: 1.5rem\n  space-xl: 2rem\n---\n\n## Brand & Style\nThis design system adapts Material Design 3 Expressive for high-security consumer networking and privacy software. It blends deep obsidian surfaces with electric cybernetic illumination, projecting impregnable operational defense, near-zero latency, and military-grade telemetry. \n\nThe aesthetic synthesizes:\n- **Glassmorphic Obsidian**: Multi-tiered semi-translucent dark surfaces featuring back-layer diffusion, fine boundary highlights, and disciplined contrast.\n- **Bioluminescent Accents**: Electric emerald and neon mint glows that function as authoritative indicators of cryptographic connection states.\n- **Cyber-Precision Telemetry**: Monospace tabular metrics paired with soft, rounded typography to balance technical credibility with consumer approachability.\n\nThe emotional signature is calming invulnerability: users transition from raw, exposed network environments into an encrypted, monitored enclosure.\n\n## Colors\nThe palette uses functional radiance atop pure dark substrates. Pure black is avoided in favor of Obsidian Black (`#0B0F17`) to prevent OLED smear and preserve subtle ambient shadows.\n\n### Surface System\n- **Main Background**: `#0B0F17` (Canvas foundation)\n- **Elevated Background**: `#101722` (Modals, bottom sheets, secondary overlays)\n- **Primary Card Surface**: `#141B26` (Standard containment cards, metric groups)\n- **Secondary Card Surface**: `#1E2638` (Interactive items inside containers, active selections)\n- **Glass Border Stroke**: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)` (Uniform 1px edge boundary)\n\n### Chromatic Roles\n- **Primary Accent (`#00E58F`)**: Electric emerald for secure states, primary interactive triggers, and core encryption halos.\n- **Highlight Accent (`#00FF85`)**: Neon mint for high-energy telemetry pings, live packet animations, and key callout states.\n- **Telemetry Cyan (`#38BDF8`)**: Downstream/upstream throughput readouts, IP details, and protocol badges.\n- **Warning Amber (`#FFBC5E`)**: Unsecured Wi-Fi alerts, latency bottlenecks, and server load warnings (>80%).\n- **Critical / Disconnected (`#FF6178`)**: Kill switch activations, dropped tunnels, and unencrypted risk warnings.\n\n### Typography & Contrast\n- **High-Emphasis Text**: `#FFFFFF` (Primary titles, essential status headers)\n- **Medium-Emphasis Text**: `#B3BAC5` (Explanatory body text, active parameter values)\n- **Low-Emphasis / Disabled**: `#737C8C` (Protocol versions, inactive headers, timestamp metadata)\n\n## Typography\nPlus Jakarta Sans provides high legibility on dark glass surfaces through open apertures, large x-height, and clean geometric forms.\n\n- **Numerics & Telemetry**: `metric-lg` and `metric-md` must be rendered with OpenType tabular figures (`font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;`) to prevent layout shifts during live ping, throughput, and IP metric updates.\n- **Hierarchy Scale**:\n  - `display-lg` / `display-md`: Large landing titles and dashboard encryption states (\"PROTECTED\", \"DISCONNECTED\").\n  - `headline-lg` / `headline-md`: Modal headers and configuration screens.\n  - `title-lg` / `title-md`: Connection status headers and selected server region names.\n  - `title-sm`: Card-level titles and parameter groupings.\n  - `body-lg` / `body-md`: Standard functional descriptions and protocol configuration body copy.\n  - `label-sm` / `label-md`: System metadata, timestamp readings, security hash previews, and secondary labels.\n\n## Layout & Spacing\nThe layout system uses an 8dp baseline grid (with 4dp sub-increments for dense data points), structured around full-width responsive containment zones.\n\n- **Grid Architecture**:\n  - **Mobile (<600dp)**: 4 fluid columns, 16dp margins, 16dp gutters. Single-column stacked cards.\n  - **Tablet (600–1024dp)**: 8 fluid columns, 32dp margins, 24dp gutters. Two-column layout split between earth wireframe telemetry and server configuration.\n  - **Desktop (>1024dp)**: 12 fluid columns, 48dp margins, 32dp gutters with a max canvas width of 1440dp.\n- **Rhythm & Safe Areas**:\n  - Top canvas maintains 16dp spacing below system status bars.\n  - Bottom edge incorporates an 88dp clearance offset to float the bottom navigation dock without obscuring interactive controls.\n- **Density**: Cards use 16dp to 24dp internal padding (`space-md` to `space-lg`), keeping compact layouts readable.\n\n## Elevation & Depth\nDepth is built with tinted ambient glows and translucent glass layering rather than traditional drop shadows.\n\n- **Base Canvas**: Pure `#0B0F17`, no elevation.\n- **Surface Elevation 1 (Cards)**:\n  - Fill: `#141B26` at 85% opacity with `backdrop-filter: blur(20px)`.\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`.\n  - Ambient Glow: Soft bottom glow (`0px 12px 32px -8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6)`).\n- **Surface Elevation 2 (Active/Connected Cards)**:\n  - Fill: `#1E2638` at 90% opacity with `backdrop-filter: blur(24px)`.\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.3)`.\n  - Ambient Glow: `0px 8px 30px rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.12)`, producing an emerald aura around the active server.\n- **Surface Elevation 3 (Floating Nav Dock & Modals)**:\n  - Fill: `#101722` at 80% opacity with `backdrop-filter: blur(28px)`.\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12)`.\n  - Ambient Shadow: `0px 20px 40px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8)`.\n\n## Shapes\nFollowing Material Design 3 Expressive principles, container shapes balance geometric structure with friendly, ergonomic corners.\n\n- **Primary & Secondary Cards**: 24dp corner radii (`rounded-xl` variant override).\n- **Floating Bottom Navigation Dock**: 28dp capsule radius for a smooth floating pill shape.\n- **Interactive Action Triggers (CTAs)**: Full capsule/pill radius (9999dp) or 24dp corner radius.\n- **Input Fields & Quick Selectors**: 16dp corner radius (`rounded-lg`).\n- **Telemetry Badges & Minor Chips**: 8dp to 12dp corner radius (`rounded-md`).\n\n## Components\n\n### Hero Connection Controller\n- The primary connection module features an interactive multi-ring component enclosing a holographic 3D wireframe Earth.\n- **Disconnected State**: Rings render in `#1E2638` with static 1px borders; central power glyph tinted `#737C8C`.\n- **Connected State**: Rings render in `#00E58F` with an outer pulsing halo (`0 0 40px rgba(0, 255, 133, 0.35)`). A subtle rotational radar sweep runs at 0.5Hz.\n- Touch target: minimum 120dp circular area with 48dp minimum internal strike-zone.\n\n### Buttons & Interactive CTAs\n- **Primary Glowing CTA**: \n  - Height: 56dp (touch safe).\n  - Background: Gradient from `#00E58F` to `#00FF85`.\n  - Text: `#0B0F17` in `label-lg` ExtraBold.\n  - Box Shadow: `0 4px 20px rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.4)`.\n  - Hover/Active: Translates to a scale of 0.98; brightness increases by 10%.\n- **Secondary Ghost Button**:\n  - Height: 48dp.\n  - Background: `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04)`.\n  - Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12)`.\n  - Text: `#FFFFFF` in `label-lg` SemiBold.\n\n### Floating Bottom Navigation Dock\n- Height: 64dp, margin: 16dp horizontal, floating 24dp above device edge.\n- Radius: 28dp, fill: `#101722` at 85% opacity with 24px blur.\n- Border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`.\n- Active Icon: Highlighted with an emerald indicator pill (`rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.15)`) with an icon color of `#00E58F`.\n- Minimum tap target for each tab: 48dp × 48dp.\n\n### Cards & Telemetry Containers\n- **Server Selection Tile**: \n  - Height: 72dp.\n  - Background: `#141B26` with 24dp radius and 1px `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)` border.\n  - Country flag indicator, server location in `title-sm`, ping latency badge in `#38BDF8`.\n  - Active state triggers a 1px border of `#00E58F` with 8% emerald fill tint.\n- **Live Metrics Card**:\n  - Two-column card showing upstream and downstream speeds.\n  - Download: Cyan (`#38BDF8`) glyph with `metric-md` numeric counter.\n  - Upload: Neon Mint (`#00FF85`) glyph with `metric-md` numeric counter.\n\n### Switches, Toggles & Checkboxes\n- **MD3 Expressive Switch**:\n  - Track: 52dp width × 32dp height, fully rounded pill. Unchecked track `#1E2638`; checked track `#00E58F`.\n  - Thumb: 24dp circle. Unchecked `#737C8C`; checked `#0B0F17`.\n  - Integrated with haptic feedback tick upon state change.\n\n### Input Fields\n- Height: 56dp.\n- Fill: `#141B26`, border: 1px solid `rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1)`. Radius: 16dp.\n- Focused State: Border changes to 1.5px solid `#00E58F` with `box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 229, 143, 0.2)`.","font":"PLUS_JAKARTA_SANS","headlineFont":"PLUS_JAKARTA_SANS","headlineFontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","labelFont":"PLUS_JAKARTA_SANS","labelFontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","namedColors":{"background":"#0f131c","error":"#ffb4ab","error_container":"#93000a","inverse_on_surface":"#2c3039","inverse_primary":"#006d41","inverse_surface":"#dfe2ee","on_background":"#dfe2ee","on_error":"#690005","on_error_container":"#ffdad6","on_primary":"#003920","on_primary_container":"#006139","on_primary_fixed":"#002110","on_primary_fixed_variant":"#005230","on_secondary":"#003919","on_secondary_container":"#007238","on_secondary_fixed":"#00210c","on_secondary_fixed_variant":"#005227","on_surface":"#dfe2ee","on_surface_variant":"#bacbbd","on_tertiary":"#00354a","on_tertiary_container":"#005a7b","on_tertiary_fixed":"#001e2c","on_tertiary_fixed_variant":"#004c69","outline":"#849588","outline_variant":"#3b4a3f","primary":"#6dffb1","primary_container":"#00e58f","primary_fixed":"#54ffaa","primary_fixed_dim":"#00e38d","secondary":"#f5fff2","secondary_container":"#36ff8b","secondary_fixed":"#61ff97","secondary_fixed_dim":"#00e476","surface":"#0f131c","surface_bright":"#353942","surface_container":"#1c2028","surface_container_high":"#262a33","surface_container_highest":"#31353e","surface_container_low":"#181c24","surface_container_lowest":"#0a0e16","surface_dim":"#0f131c","surface_tint":"#00e38d","surface_variant":"#31353e","tertiary":"#c9e9ff","tertiary_container":"#82d2ff","tertiary_fixed":"#c4e7ff","tertiary_fixed_dim":"#7bd0ff"},"overrideNeutralColor":"#0b0f17","overridePrimaryColor":"#00e58f","overrideSecondaryColor":"#00ff85","overrideTertiaryColor":"#38bdf8","roundness":"ROUND_EIGHT","spacing":{"gutter":"1rem","gutter-desktop":"2rem","gutter-tablet":"1.5rem","margin":"1rem","margin-desktop":"3rem","margin-tablet":"2rem","space-lg":"1.5rem","space-md":"1rem","space-sm":"0.5rem","space-xl":"2rem","space-xs":"0.25rem"},"spacingScale":2,"typography":{"body-lg":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"16px","fontWeight":"500","lineHeight":"24px"},"body-md":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"14px","fontWeight":"500","lineHeight":"20px"},"display-lg":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"36px","fontWeight":"800","letterSpacing":"-0.02em","lineHeight":"44px"},"display-md":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"30px","fontWeight":"800","letterSpacing":"-0.02em","lineHeight":"38px"},"headline-lg":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"28px","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"-0.01em","lineHeight":"36px"},"headline-md":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"24px","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"-0.01em","lineHeight":"32px"},"label-lg":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"14px","fontWeight":"600","letterSpacing":"0.01em","lineHeight":"20px"},"label-md":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"13px","fontWeight":"400","lineHeight":"18px"},"label-sm":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"12px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"0.02em","lineHeight":"16px"},"metric-lg":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"34px","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"-0.03em","lineHeight":"40px"},"metric-md":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"24px","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"-0.02em","lineHeight":"30px"},"title-lg":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"22px","fontWeight":"600","lineHeight":"28px"},"title-md":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"18px","fontWeight":"600","lineHeight":"24px"},"title-sm":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"16px","fontWeight":"600","lineHeight":"22px"}}}},"name":"assets/9e94db217f4d4a22bd4ec005375dd8ad","version":"1"},{"designSystem":{"displayName":"Aura Kinetic Security","manifestJson":"{\"designMd\":\"---\\nname: Aura Kinetic Security\\ncolors:\\n  surface: '#0b1326'\\n  surface-dim: '#0b1326'\\n  surface-bright: '#31394d'\\n  surface-container-lowest: '#060e20'\\n  surface-container-low: '#131b2e'\\n  surface-container: '#171f33'\\n  surface-container-high: '#222a3d'\\n  surface-container-highest: '#2d3449'\\n  on-surface: '#dae2fd'\\n  on-surface-variant: '#bdc8ce'\\n  inverse-surface: '#dae2fd'\\n  inverse-on-surface: '#283044'\\n  outline: '#879298'\\n  outline-variant: '#3e484e'\\n  surface-tint: '#64d3fd'\\n  primary: '#bfebff'\\n  on-primary: '#003545'\\n  primary-container: '#66d5ff'\\n  on-primary-container: '#005b74'\\n  inverse-primary: '#006782'\\n  secondary: '#95cfe9'\\n  on-secondary: '#003545'\\n  secondary-container: '#004d63'\\n  on-secondary-container: '#84bdd7'\\n  tertiary: '#bdebff'\\n  on-tertiary: '#003544'\\n  tertiary-container: '#a0cfe3'\\n  on-tertiary-container: '#29596b'\\n  error: '#ffb4ab'\\n  on-error: '#690005'\\n  error-container: '#93000a'\\n  on-error-container: '#ffdad6'\\n  primary-fixed: '#bbe9ff'\\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#64d3fd'\\n  on-primary-fixed: '#001f29'\\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#004d63'\\n  secondary-fixed: '#bce9ff'\\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#95cfe9'\\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#001f29'\\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#004d63'\\n  tertiary-fixed: '#baeaff'\\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#9ecee2'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#001f29'\\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#194c5e'\\n  background: '#0b1326'\\n  on-background: '#dae2fd'\\n  surface-variant: '#2d3449'\\ntypography:\\n  display-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 57px\\n    fontWeight: '700'\\n    lineHeight: 64px\\n    letterSpacing: -0.25px\\n  display-lg-mobile:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 44px\\n    fontWeight: '700'\\n    lineHeight: 52px\\n    letterSpacing: -0.2px\\n  headline-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 32px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 40px\\n    letterSpacing: 0px\\n  headline-md:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 28px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 36px\\n    letterSpacing: 0px\\n  headline-sm:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 24px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 32px\\n    letterSpacing: 0px\\n  title-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 22px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: 28px\\n    letterSpacing: 0px\\n  title-md:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 24px\\n    letterSpacing: 0.15px\\n  title-sm:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 20px\\n    letterSpacing: 0.1px\\n  body-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 16px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: 24px\\n    letterSpacing: 0.5px\\n  body-md:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: 20px\\n    letterSpacing: 0.25px\\n  body-sm:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '400'\\n    lineHeight: 16px\\n    letterSpacing: 0.4px\\n  label-lg:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 14px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 20px\\n    letterSpacing: 0.1px\\n  label-md:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 12px\\n    fontWeight: '600'\\n    lineHeight: 16px\\n    letterSpacing: 0.5px\\n  label-sm:\\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\\n    fontSize: 11px\\n    fontWeight: '500'\\n    lineHeight: 16px\\n    letterSpacing: 0.5px\\nrounded:\\n  sm: 0.5rem\\n  DEFAULT: 1rem\\n  md: 1.5rem\\n  lg: 2rem\\n  xl: 3rem\\n  full: 9999px\\nspacing:\\n  gutter: 1rem\\n  margin: 1rem\\n  gutter-tablet: 1.5rem\\n  margin-tablet: 2rem\\n  space-xs: 0.25rem\\n  space-sm: 0.5rem\\n  space-md: 1rem\\n  space-lg: 1.5rem\\n  space-xl: 2rem\\n---\\n\\n## Brand & Style\\n\\nThis design system translates next-generation mobile cybersecurity into an experience defined by calm confidence, intelligent protection, and fluid connectivity. Rather than relying on defensive alarmism or sterile utility, the interface projects an ambient shield: high-trust, unobtrusive during steady-state protection, yet dynamically expressive during transitions, threats, and state changes.\\n\\nRooted in an evolution of Material Design 3 Expressive, the aesthetic pairs disciplined, ergonomic Android architecture with luminous ambient indicators. Visual states leverage soft glowing halos, adaptive tonal surface containers, and organic pill-shaped touch surfaces. The interaction tone balances surgical privacy engineering with approachable simplicity for mobile-first workflows.\\n\\n## Colors\\n\\nThe system operates with `dark` as its primary default state, mirroring privacy-focused Android flagship applications and reducing OLED display power consumption during persistent background usage. \\n\\n### Dark Theme (Default)\\n- **Primary:** `#66D5FF` — Luminous cyber cyan/teal used for active protection indicators, primary FABs, and connected state signals.\\n- **On Primary:** `#003545` — Deep slate-teal providing high-contrast readability against glowing cyan controls.\\n- **Primary Container:** `#004D63` — Mid-tone cyan container applied to active server rows and selected segmented chips.\\n- **On Primary Container:** `#BAEAFF` — High-luminance accent tint for labels inside primary containers.\\n- **Surface:** `#0F172A` — Deep slate midnight canvas baseline.\\n- **Surface Container Low:** `#1E293B` — Resting cards, server list items, and metric groupings.\\n- **Surface Container High:** `#334155` — Elevated dialogs, active bottom sheets, and pressed states.\\n- **Outline:** `#8A9296` — Subtle boundary delineator calibrated for dark contrast compliance.\\n- **Error:** `#FFB4AB` — High-alert crimson tint for connection drops, kill switch triggers, and DNS leaks.\\n\\n### Light Theme\\n- **Primary:** `#006783` — Deep cyan for commanding actions, active toggles, and brand anchors.\\n- **On Primary:** `#FFFFFF` — Crisp optical white.\\n- **Primary Container:** `#BAEAFF` — Ice cyan background for activated utility blocks.\\n- **On Primary Container:** `#001F28` — Deepest midnight-teal text.\\n- **Surface:** `#F8FAFC` — Pure crisp backdrop.\\n- **Surface Container Low:** `#F1F5F9` — Primary grouping cards.\\n- **Surface Container High:** `#E2E8F0` — Modals, toolbars, and search bars.\\n- **Outline:** `#70787D` — Structural border definition.\\n- **Error:** `#BA1A1A` — High-visibility alert red.\\n\\nState layers apply an opacity overlay of the corresponding `on-*` color: Hover (8%), Focus (12%), Pressed (16%), and Dragged (20%).\\n\\n## Typography\\n\\nThe type system relies on `Plus Jakarta Sans` across all display, body, and label roles, using Android's system font as an immediate fallback. Its clean geometric curves and open counter forms ensure legibility at micro scales during status reporting (e.g., kilobits-per-second counters, IP addresses, latency graphs) while delivering a refined, modern tech presence on large display screens.\\n\\nNumbers in data counters, telemetry readouts, and throughput monitors must always enforce tabular figures (`font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums`) to prevent layout shifts during live ping and bandwidth fluctuations.\\n\\n## Layout & Spacing\\n\\nLayout geometry follows an 8dp structural grid, underpinned by a 4dp micro-grid for compact internal component spacing, badges, and icon pairings. All clickable targets strictly enforce a minimum touch target size of 48×48dp regardless of visual container boundary.\\n\\n- **Compact (Mobile: \\u003c 600dp):** Fluid single-column layout with 16dp (`margin`) screen edges and 16dp (`gutter`) card separation. Navigation utilizes an ergonomic bottom bar or expandable bottom sheet.\\n- **Medium (Tablet / Foldable unfolded: 600dp–839dp):** Dual-pane structure with 24dp screen padding and 32dp gutter. The primary pane houses connection controls and live status visualizations; the secondary pane houses server node directories and split-tunneling settings.\\n- **Expanded (Landscape / Large Screens: 840dp+):** Rail-based navigation with max-width content bounding containers set to 1040dp to prevent unwieldy scan lines on wide displays.\\n\\n## Elevation & Depth\\n\\nVisual hierarchy does not use sharp drop-shadows. Instead, elevation is achieved through a combination of M3 tonal layering, luminous halos, and low-contrast ghost outlines:\\n\\n1. **Surface Hierarchy (Tonal Stepping):** Depth is communicated through luminance progression. Base canvas rests on `Surface` (`#0F172A`). Resting cards sit on `Surface Container Low` (`#1E293B`). Lifted sheets, modals, and tooltips occupy `Surface Container High` (`#334155`).\\n2. **Halo Radiation (Active States):** The central connection node and active status chips project a dual-layer soft ambient glow rather than a standard shadow:\\n   - Primary Halo: `0 0 32px 0 rgba(102, 213, 255, 0.25)`\\n   - Intense Core Glow: `0 0 12px 2px rgba(102, 213, 255, 0.40)`\\n3. **Ghost Outlines:** Elevated surfaces are framed by a 1px border of `Outline` at 18% opacity, ensuring sharp separation between tonal tiers without heavy visual weight.\\n4. **Modal Elevation:** Full-screen dialogs and modal bottom sheets utilize a scrim overlay with a dynamic backdrop blur (`backdrop-filter: blur(16px)` with 60% opacity surface tint).\\n\\n## Shapes\\n\\nThe design system embraces an expressive corner philosophy, utilizing full pills for interaction touchpoints and soft rounded squircular forms for data containers:\\n\\n- **Full Pill (`9999px`):** Reserved for primary calls to action, the main connect toggle button, search input containers, chips, and navigation indicator pills.\\n- **Containers & Cards (`2rem` / 32px):** Applied to major dashboard panels, protocol configuration cards, and speed test containers.\\n- **Internal Nested Elements (`1rem` / 16px):** Used for nested sub-cards, server items within a grouped section, and secondary inputs.\\n- **Small Controls (`0.5rem` / 8px):** Checkboxes, status badges, and technical readouts.\\n\\n## Components\\n\\n### Hero Connect Button (Central Action)\\n- **Geometry:** Large 96dp circle (idle) or pill form, centered within a multi-ringed 160dp canvas.\\n- **Resting (Disconnected):** Outlined border (2dp) in `Outline` over `Surface Container Low`, containing a neutral power icon.\\n- **Active (Connected):** Filled container in `Primary` with `On Primary` icon. Enclosed by two pulsating concentric halo rings animating subtly between 12dp and 24dp scale with 20% opacity.\\n- **Connecting:** Continuous smooth angular sweep gradient rotating along the perimeter with a 4dp stroke.\\n\\n### Buttons\\n- **Primary:** Full pill (48dp height), background `Primary`, text `On Primary` (`label-lg`). Minimum width 120dp.\\n- **Tonal (Secondary):** Full pill (40dp height), background `Primary Container`, text `On Primary Container`.\\n- **Outlined:** 40dp pill, 1px border in `Outline` at 30% opacity, transparent background, text `Primary`.\\n- **Touch Target:** Internal padding at least 12dp horizontal, centered within 48dp absolute bounding box.\\n\\n### Chips (Protocol & Server Filters)\\n- **Height:** 32dp pill.\\n- **Unselected:** `Surface Container Low` with 1px border in `Outline` at 20% opacity. Text in `body-sm`.\\n- **Selected:** `Primary Container` with `On Primary Container` text, accompanied by a 16dp checkmark or active icon leading the label.\\n\\n### Server List Items\\n- **Structure:** 64dp vertical height card or continuous list item on `Surface Container Low`.\\n- **Content:** Left-aligned 28dp circular country flag avatar, followed by Server Name (`title-sm`) and City/IP (`body-sm`). Trailing block houses latency ping (color-coded badge: green `\\u003c50ms`, yellow `50–120ms`, red `\\u003e120ms`) and a favorite toggle.\\n- **Active Selection:** Bordered by a 1.5dp stroke of `Primary` with a soft 6% `Primary` surface tint.\\n\\n### Input Fields & Search Bars\\n- **Search Bar:** 48dp full pill, background `Surface Container High`, icon leading, clear action trailing. No border in resting state; 2dp `Primary` outline on focus.\\n- **Standard Text Fields:** 56dp height, rounded 16dp top and bottom corners, floating label architecture conforming to M3 specs. Background `Surface Container Low`.\\n\\n### Checkboxes, Radios, and Toggles\\n- **Switches (Kill Switch, Auto-Connect):** 32dp tall, 52dp wide pill track. Unchecked: track `Surface Container High`, thumb `Outline`. Checked: track `Primary`, thumb `On Primary` (thumb expands slightly on press).\\n- **Checkboxes:** 20×20dp box with 6dp corner radius. Checked fill `Primary` with `On Primary` check mark.\\n\\n### Telemetry / Traffic Cards\\n- **Geometry:** 24dp rounded rectangles using `Surface Container Low`.\\n- **Display:** Split-pane layout displaying Download/Upload live throughput with stylized sparklines drawn with a 2dp stroke in `Primary` and secondary muted teal. All numerical metrics use tabular figures (`title-lg`).\",\"source\":\"harness\",\"version\":1,\"isGeneratingComponents\":false,\"tokens\":{\"spacing\":[{\"id\":\"margin-tablet\",\"name\":\"margin-tablet\",\"value\":\"2rem\"},{\"name\":\"gutter-tablet\",\"value\":\"1.5rem\",\"id\":\"gutter-tablet\"},{\"id\":\"gutter\",\"name\":\"gutter\",\"value\":\"1rem\"},{\"name\":\"space-lg\",\"id\":\"space-lg\",\"value\":\"1.5rem\"},{\"value\":\"0.25rem\",\"name\":\"space-xs\",\"id\":\"space-xs\"},{\"value\":\"1rem\",\"id\":\"margin\",\"name\":\"margin\"},{\"id\":\"space-sm\",\"name\":\"space-sm\",\"value\":\"0.5rem\"},{\"id\":\"space-xl\",\"name\":\"space-xl\",\"value\":\"2rem\"},{\"value\":\"1rem\",\"id\":\"space-md\",\"name\":\"space-md\"}],\"radius\":[{\"id\":\"full\",\"value\":\"9999px\",\"name\":\"full\"},{\"name\":\"lg\",\"value\":\"2rem\",\"id\":\"lg\"},{\"id\":\"sm\",\"value\":\"0.5rem\",\"name\":\"sm\"},{\"id\":\"DEFAULT\",\"value\":\"9999px\",\"name\":\"DEFAULT\"},{\"value\":\"3rem\",\"id\":\"xl\",\"name\":\"xl\"},{\"name\":\"md\",\"id\":\"md\",\"value\":\"1.5rem\"}],\"colors\":[{\"role\":\"surface-container-low\",\"value\":\"#131b2e\",\"name\":\"Surface Container Low\",\"id\":\"surface-container-low\"},{\"foreground\":\"#001f29\",\"name\":\"Secondary Fixed\",\"value\":\"#bce9ff\",\"id\":\"secondary-fixed\",\"role\":\"secondary-fixed\"},{\"value\":\"#060e20\",\"role\":\"surface-container-lowest\",\"name\":\"Surface Container Lowest\",\"id\":\"surface-container-lowest\"},{\"name\":\"Secondary Container\",\"id\":\"secondary-container\",\"role\":\"secondary-container\",\"value\":\"#004d63\",\"foreground\":\"#84bdd7\"},{\"id\":\"inverse-surface\",\"role\":\"inverse-surface\",\"value\":\"#dae2fd\",\"name\":\"Inverse Surface\"},{\"role\":\"surface-tint\",\"value\":\"#64d3fd\",\"name\":\"Surface Tint\",\"id\":\"surface-tint\"},{\"foreground\":\"#690005\",\"value\":\"#ffb4ab\",\"role\":\"error\",\"id\":\"error\",\"name\":\"Error\"},{\"value\":\"#0b1326\",\"role\":\"surface-dim\",\"id\":\"surface-dim\",\"name\":\"Surface Dim\"},{\"id\":\"primary-fixed\",\"role\":\"primary-fixed\",\"foreground\":\"#001f29\",\"value\":\"#bbe9ff\",\"name\":\"Primary Fixed\"},{\"id\":\"tertiary\",\"value\":\"#bdebff\",\"role\":\"tertiary\",\"foreground\":\"#003544\",\"name\":\"Tertiary\"},{\"role\":\"surface-variant\",\"id\":\"surface-variant\",\"value\":\"#2d3449\",\"name\":\"Surface Variant\",\"foreground\":\"#bdc8ce\"},{\"name\":\"Tertiary Fixed\",\"id\":\"tertiary-fixed\",\"foreground\":\"#001f29\",\"role\":\"tertiary-fixed\",\"value\":\"#baeaff\"},{\"role\":\"inverse-on-surface\",\"name\":\"Inverse On Surface\",\"value\":\"#283044\",\"id\":\"inverse-on-surface\"},{\"id\":\"surface-container\",\"role\":\"surface-container\",\"value\":\"#171f33\",\"name\":\"Surface Container\"},{\"value\":\"#95cfe9\",\"id\":\"secondary-fixed-dim\",\"role\":\"secondary-fixed-dim\",\"name\":\"Secondary Fixed Dim\"},{\"value\":\"#222a3d\",\"id\":\"surface-container-high\",\"role\":\"surface-container-high\",\"name\":\"Surface Container High\"},{\"role\":\"outline\",\"name\":\"Outline\",\"value\":\"#879298\",\"id\":\"outline\"},{\"value\":\"#9ecee2\",\"role\":\"tertiary-fixed-dim\",\"name\":\"Tertiary Fixed Dim\",\"id\":\"tertiary-fixed-dim\"},{\"foreground\":\"#005b74\",\"role\":\"primary-container\",\"value\":\"#66d5ff\",\"id\":\"primary-container\",\"name\":\"Primary Container\"},{\"id\":\"surface-container-highest\",\"role\":\"surface-container-highest\",\"name\":\"Surface Container Highest\",\"value\":\"#2d3449\"},{\"role\":\"primary-fixed-dim\",\"name\":\"Primary Fixed Dim\",\"id\":\"primary-fixed-dim\",\"value\":\"#64d3fd\"},{\"role\":\"neutral\",\"value\":\"#0f172a\",\"name\":\"Neutral\",\"id\":\"neutral\"},{\"id\":\"inverse-primary\",\"role\":\"inverse-primary\",\"value\":\"#006782\",\"name\":\"Inverse Primary\"},{\"role\":\"secondary\",\"name\":\"Secondary\",\"value\":\"#95cfe9\",\"foreground\":\"#003545\",\"id\":\"secondary\"},{\"foreground\":\"#dae2fd\",\"id\":\"surface\",\"value\":\"#0b1326\",\"role\":\"surface\",\"name\":\"Surface\"},{\"foreground\":\"#dae2fd\",\"role\":\"background\",\"name\":\"Background\",\"value\":\"#0b1326\",\"id\":\"background\"},{\"foreground\":\"#29596b\",\"role\":\"tertiary-container\",\"value\":\"#a0cfe3\",\"name\":\"Tertiary Container\",\"id\":\"tertiary-container\"},{\"role\":\"surface-bright\",\"value\":\"#31394d\",\"id\":\"surface-bright\",\"name\":\"Surface Bright\"},{\"id\":\"outline-variant\",\"role\":\"outline-variant\",\"name\":\"Outline Variant\",\"value\":\"#3e484e\"},{\"id\":\"primary\",\"name\":\"Primary\",\"value\":\"#bfebff\",\"foreground\":\"#003545\",\"role\":\"primary\"},{\"foreground\":\"#ffdad6\",\"name\":\"Error Container\",\"value\":\"#93000a\",\"role\":\"error-container\",\"id\":\"error-container\"}],\"surface\":{\"dark\":{\"outline\":\"#3e484e\",\"background\":\"#0b1326\",\"surface\":\"#171f33\",\"onSurface\":\"#bdc8ce\",\"foreground\":\"#dae2fd\"},\"light\":{\"outline\":\"#3e484e\",\"onSurface\":\"#bdc8ce\",\"background\":\"#0b1326\",\"foreground\":\"#dae2fd\",\"surface\":\"#171f33\"}},\"type\":[{\"lineHeight\":\"40px\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"name\":\"Headline LG\",\"size\":\"32px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0px\",\"weight\":\"600\",\"id\":\"headline-lg\"},{\"id\":\"title-md\",\"name\":\"Title MD\",\"size\":\"16px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0.15px\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"weight\":\"600\",\"lineHeight\":\"24px\"},{\"lineHeight\":\"16px\",\"name\":\"Label SM\",\"size\":\"11px\",\"id\":\"label-sm\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0.5px\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"weight\":\"500\"},{\"name\":\"Label LG\",\"size\":\"14px\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"weight\":\"600\",\"lineHeight\":\"20px\",\"id\":\"label-lg\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0.1px\"},{\"name\":\"Title SM\",\"size\":\"14px\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"id\":\"title-sm\",\"weight\":\"600\",\"lineHeight\":\"20px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0.1px\"},{\"name\":\"Body LG\",\"size\":\"16px\",\"id\":\"body-lg\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0.5px\",\"lineHeight\":\"24px\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"weight\":\"400\"},{\"name\":\"Body MD\",\"size\":\"14px\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"weight\":\"400\",\"id\":\"body-md\",\"lineHeight\":\"20px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0.25px\"},{\"weight\":\"600\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"id\":\"headline-md\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0px\",\"name\":\"Headline MD\",\"size\":\"28px\",\"lineHeight\":\"36px\"},{\"letterSpacing\":\"0.4px\",\"weight\":\"400\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"lineHeight\":\"16px\",\"id\":\"body-sm\",\"name\":\"Body SM\",\"size\":\"12px\"},{\"lineHeight\":\"28px\",\"weight\":\"500\",\"name\":\"Title LG\",\"size\":\"22px\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0px\",\"id\":\"title-lg\"},{\"name\":\"Label MD\",\"size\":\"12px\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0.5px\",\"lineHeight\":\"16px\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"weight\":\"600\",\"id\":\"label-md\"},{\"weight\":\"600\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"id\":\"headline-sm\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0px\",\"lineHeight\":\"32px\",\"name\":\"Headline SM\",\"size\":\"24px\"},{\"id\":\"display-lg\",\"letterSpacing\":\"-0.25px\",\"weight\":\"700\",\"lineHeight\":\"64px\",\"family\":\"Plus Jakarta Sans\",\"name\":\"Display LG\",\"size\":\"57px\"}]},\"identity\":{\"name\":\"Aura Kinetic Security\"}}","styleGuidelines":"## Brand & Style\n\nThis design system translates next-generation mobile cybersecurity into an experience defined by calm confidence, intelligent protection, and fluid connectivity. Rather than relying on defensive alarmism or sterile utility, the interface projects an ambient shield: high-trust, unobtrusive during steady-state protection, yet dynamically expressive during transitions, threats, and state changes.\n\nRooted in an evolution of Material Design 3 Expressive, the aesthetic pairs disciplined, ergonomic Android architecture with luminous ambient indicators. Visual states leverage soft glowing halos, adaptive tonal surface containers, and organic pill-shaped touch surfaces. The interaction tone balances surgical privacy engineering with approachable simplicity for mobile-first workflows.\n\n## Layout & Spacing\n\nLayout geometry follows an 8dp structural grid, underpinned by a 4dp micro-grid for compact internal component spacing, badges, and icon pairings. All clickable targets strictly enforce a minimum touch target size of 48×48dp regardless of visual container boundary.\n\n- **Compact (Mobile: < 600dp):** Fluid single-column layout with 16dp (`margin`) screen edges and 16dp (`gutter`) card separation. Navigation utilizes an ergonomic bottom bar or expandable bottom sheet.\n- **Medium (Tablet / Foldable unfolded: 600dp–839dp):** Dual-pane structure with 24dp screen padding and 32dp gutter. The primary pane houses connection controls and live status visualizations; the secondary pane houses server node directories and split-tunneling settings.\n- **Expanded (Landscape / Large Screens: 840dp+):** Rail-based navigation with max-width content bounding containers set to 1040dp to prevent unwieldy scan lines on wide displays.\n\n## Elevation & Depth\n\nVisual hierarchy does not use sharp drop-shadows. Instead, elevation is achieved through a combination of M3 tonal layering, luminous halos, and low-contrast ghost outlines:\n\n1. **Surface Hierarchy (Tonal Stepping):** Depth is communicated through luminance progression. Base canvas rests on `Surface` (`#0F172A`). Resting cards sit on `Surface Container Low` (`#1E293B`). Lifted sheets, modals, and tooltips occupy `Surface Container High` (`#334155`).\n2. **Halo Radiation (Active States):** The central connection node and active status chips project a dual-layer soft ambient glow rather than a standard shadow:\n   - Primary Halo: `0 0 32px 0 rgba(102, 213, 255, 0.25)`\n   - Intense Core Glow: `0 0 12px 2px rgba(102, 213, 255, 0.40)`\n3. **Ghost Outlines:** Elevated surfaces are framed by a 1px border of `Outline` at 18% opacity, ensuring sharp separation between tonal tiers without heavy visual weight.\n4. **Modal Elevation:** Full-screen dialogs and modal bottom sheets utilize a scrim overlay with a dynamic backdrop blur (`backdrop-filter: blur(16px)` with 60% opacity surface tint).\n\n## Components\n\n### Hero Connect Button (Central Action)\n- **Geometry:** Large 96dp circle (idle) or pill form, centered within a multi-ringed 160dp canvas.\n- **Resting (Disconnected):** Outlined border (2dp) in `Outline` over `Surface Container Low`, containing a neutral power icon.\n- **Active (Connected):** Filled container in `Primary` with `On Primary` icon. Enclosed by two pulsating concentric halo rings animating subtly between 12dp and 24dp scale with 20% opacity.\n- **Connecting:** Continuous smooth angular sweep gradient rotating along the perimeter with a 4dp stroke.\n\n### Buttons\n- **Primary:** Full pill (48dp height), background `Primary`, text `On Primary` (`label-lg`). Minimum width 120dp.\n- **Tonal (Secondary):** Full pill (40dp height), background `Primary Container`, text `On Primary Container`.\n- **Outlined:** 40dp pill, 1px border in `Outline` at 30% opacity, transparent background, text `Primary`.\n- **Touch Target:** Internal padding at least 12dp horizontal, centered within 48dp absolute bounding box.\n\n### Chips (Protocol & Server Filters)\n- **Height:** 32dp pill.\n- **Unselected:** `Surface Container Low` with 1px border in `Outline` at 20% opacity. Text in `body-sm`.\n- **Selected:** `Primary Container` with `On Primary Container` text, accompanied by a 16dp checkmark or active icon leading the label.\n\n### Server List Items\n- **Structure:** 64dp vertical height card or continuous list item on `Surface Container Low`.\n- **Content:** Left-aligned 28dp circular country flag avatar, followed by Server Name (`title-sm`) and City/IP (`body-sm`). Trailing block houses latency ping (color-coded badge: green `<50ms`, yellow `50–120ms`, red `>120ms`) and a favorite toggle.\n- **Active Selection:** Bordered by a 1.5dp stroke of `Primary` with a soft 6% `Primary` surface tint.\n\n### Input Fields & Search Bars\n- **Search Bar:** 48dp full pill, background `Surface Container High`, icon leading, clear action trailing. No border in resting state; 2dp `Primary` outline on focus.\n- **Standard Text Fields:** 56dp height, rounded 16dp top and bottom corners, floating label architecture conforming to M3 specs. Background `Surface Container Low`.\n\n### Checkboxes, Radios, and Toggles\n- **Switches (Kill Switch, Auto-Connect):** 32dp tall, 52dp wide pill track. Unchecked: track `Surface Container High`, thumb `Outline`. Checked: track `Primary`, thumb `On Primary` (thumb expands slightly on press).\n- **Checkboxes:** 20×20dp box with 6dp corner radius. Checked fill `Primary` with `On Primary` check mark.\n\n### Telemetry / Traffic Cards\n- **Geometry:** 24dp rounded rectangles using `Surface Container Low`.\n- **Display:** Split-pane layout displaying Download/Upload live throughput with stylized sparklines drawn with a 2dp stroke in `Primary` and secondary muted teal. All numerical metrics use tabular figures (`title-lg`).","theme":{"bodyFont":"PLUS_JAKARTA_SANS","bodyFontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","colorMode":"DARK","colorVariant":"FIDELITY","customColor":"#66d5ff","designMd":"---\nname: Aura Kinetic Security\ncolors:\n  surface: '#0b1326'\n  surface-dim: '#0b1326'\n  surface-bright: '#31394d'\n  surface-container-lowest: '#060e20'\n  surface-container-low: '#131b2e'\n  surface-container: '#171f33'\n  surface-container-high: '#222a3d'\n  surface-container-highest: '#2d3449'\n  on-surface: '#dae2fd'\n  on-surface-variant: '#bdc8ce'\n  inverse-surface: '#dae2fd'\n  inverse-on-surface: '#283044'\n  outline: '#879298'\n  outline-variant: '#3e484e'\n  surface-tint: '#64d3fd'\n  primary: '#bfebff'\n  on-primary: '#003545'\n  primary-container: '#66d5ff'\n  on-primary-container: '#005b74'\n  inverse-primary: '#006782'\n  secondary: '#95cfe9'\n  on-secondary: '#003545'\n  secondary-container: '#004d63'\n  on-secondary-container: '#84bdd7'\n  tertiary: '#bdebff'\n  on-tertiary: '#003544'\n  tertiary-container: '#a0cfe3'\n  on-tertiary-container: '#29596b'\n  error: '#ffb4ab'\n  on-error: '#690005'\n  error-container: '#93000a'\n  on-error-container: '#ffdad6'\n  primary-fixed: '#bbe9ff'\n  primary-fixed-dim: '#64d3fd'\n  on-primary-fixed: '#001f29'\n  on-primary-fixed-variant: '#004d63'\n  secondary-fixed: '#bce9ff'\n  secondary-fixed-dim: '#95cfe9'\n  on-secondary-fixed: '#001f29'\n  on-secondary-fixed-variant: '#004d63'\n  tertiary-fixed: '#baeaff'\n  tertiary-fixed-dim: '#9ecee2'\n  on-tertiary-fixed: '#001f29'\n  on-tertiary-fixed-variant: '#194c5e'\n  background: '#0b1326'\n  on-background: '#dae2fd'\n  surface-variant: '#2d3449'\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 57px\n    fontWeight: '700'\n    lineHeight: 64px\n    letterSpacing: -0.25px\n  display-lg-mobile:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 44px\n    fontWeight: '700'\n    lineHeight: 52px\n    letterSpacing: -0.2px\n  headline-lg:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 32px\n    fontWeight: '600'\n    lineHeight: 40px\n    letterSpacing: 0px\n  headline-md:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 28px\n    fontWeight: '600'\n    lineHeight: 36px\n    letterSpacing: 0px\n  headline-sm:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 24px\n    fontWeight: '600'\n    lineHeight: 32px\n    letterSpacing: 0px\n  title-lg:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 22px\n    fontWeight: '500'\n    lineHeight: 28px\n    letterSpacing: 0px\n  title-md:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 16px\n    fontWeight: '600'\n    lineHeight: 24px\n    letterSpacing: 0.15px\n  title-sm:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 14px\n    fontWeight: '600'\n    lineHeight: 20px\n    letterSpacing: 0.1px\n  body-lg:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 16px\n    fontWeight: '400'\n    lineHeight: 24px\n    letterSpacing: 0.5px\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 14px\n    fontWeight: '400'\n    lineHeight: 20px\n    letterSpacing: 0.25px\n  body-sm:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 12px\n    fontWeight: '400'\n    lineHeight: 16px\n    letterSpacing: 0.4px\n  label-lg:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 14px\n    fontWeight: '600'\n    lineHeight: 20px\n    letterSpacing: 0.1px\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 12px\n    fontWeight: '600'\n    lineHeight: 16px\n    letterSpacing: 0.5px\n  label-sm:\n    fontFamily: Plus Jakarta Sans\n    fontSize: 11px\n    fontWeight: '500'\n    lineHeight: 16px\n    letterSpacing: 0.5px\nrounded:\n  sm: 0.5rem\n  DEFAULT: 1rem\n  md: 1.5rem\n  lg: 2rem\n  xl: 3rem\n  full: 9999px\nspacing:\n  gutter: 1rem\n  margin: 1rem\n  gutter-tablet: 1.5rem\n  margin-tablet: 2rem\n  space-xs: 0.25rem\n  space-sm: 0.5rem\n  space-md: 1rem\n  space-lg: 1.5rem\n  space-xl: 2rem\n---\n\n## Brand & Style\n\nThis design system translates next-generation mobile cybersecurity into an experience defined by calm confidence, intelligent protection, and fluid connectivity. Rather than relying on defensive alarmism or sterile utility, the interface projects an ambient shield: high-trust, unobtrusive during steady-state protection, yet dynamically expressive during transitions, threats, and state changes.\n\nRooted in an evolution of Material Design 3 Expressive, the aesthetic pairs disciplined, ergonomic Android architecture with luminous ambient indicators. Visual states leverage soft glowing halos, adaptive tonal surface containers, and organic pill-shaped touch surfaces. The interaction tone balances surgical privacy engineering with approachable simplicity for mobile-first workflows.\n\n## Colors\n\nThe system operates with `dark` as its primary default state, mirroring privacy-focused Android flagship applications and reducing OLED display power consumption during persistent background usage. \n\n### Dark Theme (Default)\n- **Primary:** `#66D5FF` — Luminous cyber cyan/teal used for active protection indicators, primary FABs, and connected state signals.\n- **On Primary:** `#003545` — Deep slate-teal providing high-contrast readability against glowing cyan controls.\n- **Primary Container:** `#004D63` — Mid-tone cyan container applied to active server rows and selected segmented chips.\n- **On Primary Container:** `#BAEAFF` — High-luminance accent tint for labels inside primary containers.\n- **Surface:** `#0F172A` — Deep slate midnight canvas baseline.\n- **Surface Container Low:** `#1E293B` — Resting cards, server list items, and metric groupings.\n- **Surface Container High:** `#334155` — Elevated dialogs, active bottom sheets, and pressed states.\n- **Outline:** `#8A9296` — Subtle boundary delineator calibrated for dark contrast compliance.\n- **Error:** `#FFB4AB` — High-alert crimson tint for connection drops, kill switch triggers, and DNS leaks.\n\n### Light Theme\n- **Primary:** `#006783` — Deep cyan for commanding actions, active toggles, and brand anchors.\n- **On Primary:** `#FFFFFF` — Crisp optical white.\n- **Primary Container:** `#BAEAFF` — Ice cyan background for activated utility blocks.\n- **On Primary Container:** `#001F28` — Deepest midnight-teal text.\n- **Surface:** `#F8FAFC` — Pure crisp backdrop.\n- **Surface Container Low:** `#F1F5F9` — Primary grouping cards.\n- **Surface Container High:** `#E2E8F0` — Modals, toolbars, and search bars.\n- **Outline:** `#70787D` — Structural border definition.\n- **Error:** `#BA1A1A` — High-visibility alert red.\n\nState layers apply an opacity overlay of the corresponding `on-*` color: Hover (8%), Focus (12%), Pressed (16%), and Dragged (20%).\n\n## Typography\n\nThe type system relies on `Plus Jakarta Sans` across all display, body, and label roles, using Android's system font as an immediate fallback. Its clean geometric curves and open counter forms ensure legibility at micro scales during status reporting (e.g., kilobits-per-second counters, IP addresses, latency graphs) while delivering a refined, modern tech presence on large display screens.\n\nNumbers in data counters, telemetry readouts, and throughput monitors must always enforce tabular figures (`font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums`) to prevent layout shifts during live ping and bandwidth fluctuations.\n\n## Layout & Spacing\n\nLayout geometry follows an 8dp structural grid, underpinned by a 4dp micro-grid for compact internal component spacing, badges, and icon pairings. All clickable targets strictly enforce a minimum touch target size of 48×48dp regardless of visual container boundary.\n\n- **Compact (Mobile: < 600dp):** Fluid single-column layout with 16dp (`margin`) screen edges and 16dp (`gutter`) card separation. Navigation utilizes an ergonomic bottom bar or expandable bottom sheet.\n- **Medium (Tablet / Foldable unfolded: 600dp–839dp):** Dual-pane structure with 24dp screen padding and 32dp gutter. The primary pane houses connection controls and live status visualizations; the secondary pane houses server node directories and split-tunneling settings.\n- **Expanded (Landscape / Large Screens: 840dp+):** Rail-based navigation with max-width content bounding containers set to 1040dp to prevent unwieldy scan lines on wide displays.\n\n## Elevation & Depth\n\nVisual hierarchy does not use sharp drop-shadows. Instead, elevation is achieved through a combination of M3 tonal layering, luminous halos, and low-contrast ghost outlines:\n\n1. **Surface Hierarchy (Tonal Stepping):** Depth is communicated through luminance progression. Base canvas rests on `Surface` (`#0F172A`). Resting cards sit on `Surface Container Low` (`#1E293B`). Lifted sheets, modals, and tooltips occupy `Surface Container High` (`#334155`).\n2. **Halo Radiation (Active States):** The central connection node and active status chips project a dual-layer soft ambient glow rather than a standard shadow:\n   - Primary Halo: `0 0 32px 0 rgba(102, 213, 255, 0.25)`\n   - Intense Core Glow: `0 0 12px 2px rgba(102, 213, 255, 0.40)`\n3. **Ghost Outlines:** Elevated surfaces are framed by a 1px border of `Outline` at 18% opacity, ensuring sharp separation between tonal tiers without heavy visual weight.\n4. **Modal Elevation:** Full-screen dialogs and modal bottom sheets utilize a scrim overlay with a dynamic backdrop blur (`backdrop-filter: blur(16px)` with 60% opacity surface tint).\n\n## Shapes\n\nThe design system embraces an expressive corner philosophy, utilizing full pills for interaction touchpoints and soft rounded squircular forms for data containers:\n\n- **Full Pill (`9999px`):** Reserved for primary calls to action, the main connect toggle button, search input containers, chips, and navigation indicator pills.\n- **Containers & Cards (`2rem` / 32px):** Applied to major dashboard panels, protocol configuration cards, and speed test containers.\n- **Internal Nested Elements (`1rem` / 16px):** Used for nested sub-cards, server items within a grouped section, and secondary inputs.\n- **Small Controls (`0.5rem` / 8px):** Checkboxes, status badges, and technical readouts.\n\n## Components\n\n### Hero Connect Button (Central Action)\n- **Geometry:** Large 96dp circle (idle) or pill form, centered within a multi-ringed 160dp canvas.\n- **Resting (Disconnected):** Outlined border (2dp) in `Outline` over `Surface Container Low`, containing a neutral power icon.\n- **Active (Connected):** Filled container in `Primary` with `On Primary` icon. Enclosed by two pulsating concentric halo rings animating subtly between 12dp and 24dp scale with 20% opacity.\n- **Connecting:** Continuous smooth angular sweep gradient rotating along the perimeter with a 4dp stroke.\n\n### Buttons\n- **Primary:** Full pill (48dp height), background `Primary`, text `On Primary` (`label-lg`). Minimum width 120dp.\n- **Tonal (Secondary):** Full pill (40dp height), background `Primary Container`, text `On Primary Container`.\n- **Outlined:** 40dp pill, 1px border in `Outline` at 30% opacity, transparent background, text `Primary`.\n- **Touch Target:** Internal padding at least 12dp horizontal, centered within 48dp absolute bounding box.\n\n### Chips (Protocol & Server Filters)\n- **Height:** 32dp pill.\n- **Unselected:** `Surface Container Low` with 1px border in `Outline` at 20% opacity. Text in `body-sm`.\n- **Selected:** `Primary Container` with `On Primary Container` text, accompanied by a 16dp checkmark or active icon leading the label.\n\n### Server List Items\n- **Structure:** 64dp vertical height card or continuous list item on `Surface Container Low`.\n- **Content:** Left-aligned 28dp circular country flag avatar, followed by Server Name (`title-sm`) and City/IP (`body-sm`). Trailing block houses latency ping (color-coded badge: green `<50ms`, yellow `50–120ms`, red `>120ms`) and a favorite toggle.\n- **Active Selection:** Bordered by a 1.5dp stroke of `Primary` with a soft 6% `Primary` surface tint.\n\n### Input Fields & Search Bars\n- **Search Bar:** 48dp full pill, background `Surface Container High`, icon leading, clear action trailing. No border in resting state; 2dp `Primary` outline on focus.\n- **Standard Text Fields:** 56dp height, rounded 16dp top and bottom corners, floating label architecture conforming to M3 specs. Background `Surface Container Low`.\n\n### Checkboxes, Radios, and Toggles\n- **Switches (Kill Switch, Auto-Connect):** 32dp tall, 52dp wide pill track. Unchecked: track `Surface Container High`, thumb `Outline`. Checked: track `Primary`, thumb `On Primary` (thumb expands slightly on press).\n- **Checkboxes:** 20×20dp box with 6dp corner radius. Checked fill `Primary` with `On Primary` check mark.\n\n### Telemetry / Traffic Cards\n- **Geometry:** 24dp rounded rectangles using `Surface Container Low`.\n- **Display:** Split-pane layout displaying Download/Upload live throughput with stylized sparklines drawn with a 2dp stroke in `Primary` and secondary muted teal. All numerical metrics use tabular figures (`title-lg`).","font":"PLUS_JAKARTA_SANS","headlineFont":"PLUS_JAKARTA_SANS","headlineFontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","labelFont":"PLUS_JAKARTA_SANS","labelFontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","namedColors":{"background":"#0b1326","error":"#ffb4ab","error_container":"#93000a","inverse_on_surface":"#283044","inverse_primary":"#006782","inverse_surface":"#dae2fd","on_background":"#dae2fd","on_error":"#690005","on_error_container":"#ffdad6","on_primary":"#003545","on_primary_container":"#005b74","on_primary_fixed":"#001f29","on_primary_fixed_variant":"#004d63","on_secondary":"#003545","on_secondary_container":"#84bdd7","on_secondary_fixed":"#001f29","on_secondary_fixed_variant":"#004d63","on_surface":"#dae2fd","on_surface_variant":"#bdc8ce","on_tertiary":"#003544","on_tertiary_container":"#29596b","on_tertiary_fixed":"#001f29","on_tertiary_fixed_variant":"#194c5e","outline":"#879298","outline_variant":"#3e484e","primary":"#bfebff","primary_container":"#66d5ff","primary_fixed":"#bbe9ff","primary_fixed_dim":"#64d3fd","secondary":"#95cfe9","secondary_container":"#004d63","secondary_fixed":"#bce9ff","secondary_fixed_dim":"#95cfe9","surface":"#0b1326","surface_bright":"#31394d","surface_container":"#171f33","surface_container_high":"#222a3d","surface_container_highest":"#2d3449","surface_container_low":"#131b2e","surface_container_lowest":"#060e20","surface_dim":"#0b1326","surface_tint":"#64d3fd","surface_variant":"#2d3449","tertiary":"#bdebff","tertiary_container":"#a0cfe3","tertiary_fixed":"#baeaff","tertiary_fixed_dim":"#9ecee2"},"overrideNeutralColor":"#0f172a","overridePrimaryColor":"#66d5ff","overrideSecondaryColor":"#004d63","overrideTertiaryColor":"#baeaff","roundness":"ROUND_FULL","spacing":{"gutter":"1rem","gutter-tablet":"1.5rem","margin":"1rem","margin-tablet":"2rem","space-lg":"1.5rem","space-md":"1rem","space-sm":"0.5rem","space-xl":"2rem","space-xs":"0.25rem"},"spacingScale":2,"typography":{"body-lg":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"16px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"0.5px","lineHeight":"24px"},"body-md":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"14px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"0.25px","lineHeight":"20px"},"body-sm":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"12px","fontWeight":"400","letterSpacing":"0.4px","lineHeight":"16px"},"display-lg":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"57px","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"-0.25px","lineHeight":"64px"},"display-lg-mobile":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"44px","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":"-0.2px","lineHeight":"52px"},"headline-lg":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"32px","fontWeight":"600","letterSpacing":"0px","lineHeight":"40px"},"headline-md":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"28px","fontWeight":"600","letterSpacing":"0px","lineHeight":"36px"},"headline-sm":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"24px","fontWeight":"600","letterSpacing":"0px","lineHeight":"32px"},"label-lg":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"14px","fontWeight":"600","letterSpacing":"0.1px","lineHeight":"20px"},"label-md":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"12px","fontWeight":"600","letterSpacing":"0.5px","lineHeight":"16px"},"label-sm":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"11px","fontWeight":"500","letterSpacing":"0.5px","lineHeight":"16px"},"title-lg":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"22px","fontWeight":"500","letterSpacing":"0px","lineHeight":"28px"},"title-md":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"16px","fontWeight":"600","letterSpacing":"0.15px","lineHeight":"24px"},"title-sm":{"fontFamily":"Plus Jakarta Sans","fontSize":"14px","fontWeight":"600","letterSpacing":"0.1px","lineHeight":"20px"}}}},"name":"assets/b157359ff24d43079924fa8e44a3d27c","version":"1"}]}}}